(2465602, 339746, 18207, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the sharp tongue, but tourists shoot like this. Straight ahead (and not even shot from the center as it can be seen at the top roof), composed to the dead center, flag poles are neither in or out, perspective not corrected, colors are flat, no details in the sky. Maybe some of these problems came from your equipment, but please work on the others.<br/>Don''t take me wrong, I''m telling you all the bad things to help, not to degrade your work. 4 from me now.</td>', 'Sorry for the sharp tongue, but tourists shoot like this. Straight ahead (and not even shot from the center as it can be seen at the top roof), composed to the dead center, flag poles are neither in or out, perspective not corrected, colors are flat, no details in the sky. Maybe some of these problems came from your equipment, but please work on the others.Don''t take me wrong, I''m telling you all the bad things to help, not to degrade your work. 4 from me now.', '2006-05-29 08:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
