(2465884, 339656, 36006, '<td valign="top">This is definetly out of the box imagery.<br/> <br/>My first thoughts without reading your title was that this city really looks like compueter crap. An so it was.<br/> <br/>Good comp, great texture, good light, good color, the blue bg is way flat for me, no dimensional value so therefor dof lost, nice movement, nice lines</td>', 'This is definetly out of the box imagery. My first thoughts without reading your title was that this city really looks like compueter crap. An so it was. Good comp, great texture, good light, good color, the blue bg is way flat for me, no dimensional value so therefor dof lost, nice movement, nice lines', '2006-05-29 10:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2465886, 339624, 57886, '<td valign="top">Is it a real house!! Nice picture :o)</td>', 'Is it a real house!! Nice picture :o)', '2006-05-29 10:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2465887, 339740, 12857, '<td valign="top">Tad hot, but you snap it when you can get it.   Great mood.</td>', 'Tad hot, but you snap it when you can get it.   Great mood.', '2006-05-29 10:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
