(2466460, 338461, 35602, '<td valign="top">The soft treatment gives the image an almost surreal look.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'The soft treatment gives the image an almost surreal look.  Very nicely done.', '2006-05-29 15:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466462, 339006, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good composition.  For me, though, the person kind of takes away from the beauty of the reflection on the floor.  Would have also liked to see more details on the pews.</td>', 'Very good composition.  For me, though, the person kind of takes away from the beauty of the reflection on the floor.  Would have also liked to see more details on the pews.', '2006-05-29 15:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466466, 339166, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love these buildings.  The wonderful curves give this a feeling of motion.  The architect who designed this did a terrific job.</td>', 'Love these buildings.  The wonderful curves give this a feeling of motion.  The architect who designed this did a terrific job.', '2006-05-29 15:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466469, 339633, 58840, '<td valign="top">9!!  awesome look and feel</td>', '9!!  awesome look and feel', '2006-05-29 15:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466473, 339843, 58840, '<td valign="top">stunning!  9!</td>', 'stunning!  9!', '2006-05-29 15:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466474, 339421, 58840, '<td valign="top">wow!  9!!</td>', 'wow!  9!!', '2006-05-29 15:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466475, 339672, 56254, '<td valign="top">sky seems a bit flat to me</td>', 'sky seems a bit flat to me', '2006-05-29 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466477, 339787, 56254, '<td valign="top">a bit too busy for my taste, would like to see just the chateau and no stairs</td>', 'a bit too busy for my taste, would like to see just the chateau and no stairs', '2006-05-29 15:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466478, 339776, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Color balance seems to have too much cyan, I think.  Makes the sky look very greenish.  Using layers and extracting the sky to color correct the building would have helped.  Also it could have allowed you to add more contrast to the building without messing up the sky.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Color balance seems to have too much cyan, I think.  Makes the sky look very greenish.  Using layers and extracting the sky to color correct the building would have helped.  Also it could have allowed you to add more contrast to the building without messing up the sky.', '2006-05-29 15:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466485, 338826, 35602, '<td valign="top">Just don''t find the subject all that great.  You did a nice job on the colors, though.  Also the image is tilted.  You can straighten the composition to get less slant.</td>', 'Just don''t find the subject all that great.  You did a nice job on the colors, though.  Also the image is tilted.  You can straighten the composition to get less slant.', '2006-05-29 15:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466486, 339589, 58840, '<td valign="top">stunning!!  10!</td>', 'stunning!!  10!', '2006-05-29 15:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466489, 339726, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of repetition of the stairs with the building side.  Need more light on the stairs to really get the full impact of this image.</td>', 'I like the idea of repetition of the stairs with the building side.  Need more light on the stairs to really get the full impact of this image.', '2006-05-29 15:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466491, 339740, 35602, '<td valign="top">Could use more contrast, though your exposure was well done.  Like the clothes in the foreground.  Need to be better focused too.</td>', 'Could use more contrast, though your exposure was well done.  Like the clothes in the foreground.  Need to be better focused too.', '2006-05-29 15:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466494, 338729, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the way these buildings repeat the patterns.  You have  a great eye for composition.</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the way these buildings repeat the patterns.  You have  a great eye for composition.', '2006-05-29 15:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466499, 339863, 58158, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! 10/10</td>', 'Brilliant! 10/10', '2006-05-29 15:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466505, 339849, 35602, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the center of the building is done.  You may have put too much into the composition.  Simplifying it by maybe staying with a smaller portion of the image might have more impact.</td>', 'I really like the way the center of the building is done.  You may have put too much into the composition.  Simplifying it by maybe staying with a smaller portion of the image might have more impact.', '2006-05-29 15:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466513, 339603, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image is very dark, which would work with a bit of mist.  The extreme heavy shadows take away from the architecture of the building.  Still, it is a nice building to know about, which is one of things I am getting out of the challenge.  Have you tried using something like a fog filter on your camera, just to see what kind of an effect you might get?</td>', 'Image is very dark, which would work with a bit of mist.  The extreme heavy shadows take away from the architecture of the building.  Still, it is a nice building to know about, which is one of things I am getting out of the challenge.  Have you tried using something like a fog filter on your camera, just to see what kind of an effect you might get?', '2006-05-29 15:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466516, 339124, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow I really like the colours in this. The reflections off the columns are neat too.</td>', 'Wow I really like the colours in this. The reflections off the columns are neat too.', '2006-05-29 15:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466517, 339580, 43774, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t get much more impressive or cool than this. A very unique angle!</td>', 'It doesn''t get much more impressive or cool than this. A very unique angle!', '2006-05-29 15:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466519, 339544, 55427, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop staring at it... in a good way. :)</td>', 'I can''t stop staring at it... in a good way. :)', '2006-05-29 15:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466525, 339883, 43774, '<td valign="top">There is some sort of halo all around the dome, that is very distracting and really takes away from the photograph. I do like the green dome, it stands out among the muted colours of the brick.</td>', 'There is some sort of halo all around the dome, that is very distracting and really takes away from the photograph. I do like the green dome, it stands out among the muted colours of the brick.', '2006-05-29 15:49:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2466527, 339861, 43774, '<td valign="top">Your image looks too contrasty, almost as if you over sharpened it to make up for poor focus. It is not helping the photo at all.</td>', 'Your image looks too contrasty, almost as if you over sharpened it to make up for poor focus. It is not helping the photo at all.', '2006-05-29 15:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466529, 339882, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is very well defined, and your shadows are also showing details.  The deep blue of the sky enhances the orangy shades of the lighting.  Really well done.</td>', 'This is very well defined, and your shadows are also showing details.  The deep blue of the sky enhances the orangy shades of the lighting.  Really well done.', '2006-05-29 15:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466530, 338986, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo, great angle and different architecture. It appears a bit dull, though. Needs to be brightened up a bit.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo, great angle and different architecture. It appears a bit dull, though. Needs to be brightened up a bit.', '2006-05-29 15:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466537, 339240, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think if the sign weren''t there this photo would have much more impact. As it is now it just looks like what it is.....a photo turned on its side. It''s similar to one I''ve seen on this site before....the Museum of Civilization, right?</td>', 'I think if the sign weren''t there this photo would have much more impact. As it is now it just looks like what it is.....a photo turned on its side. It''s similar to one I''ve seen on this site before....the Museum of Civilization, right?', '2006-05-29 15:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466539, 339668, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cool colours, good angle, lots of interest.</td>', 'Very cool colours, good angle, lots of interest.', '2006-05-29 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466541, 339283, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful architecture, great angle, looks good in B&amp;W. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful architecture, great angle, looks good in B&W. Well done.', '2006-05-29 15:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466543, 339094, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you did in your post processing, but there are some weird artifacts in the sky and water. Looks like it''s been polarized or solarized. Not flattering to the photo at all.</td>', 'Not sure what you did in your post processing, but there are some weird artifacts in the sky and water. Looks like it''s been polarized or solarized. Not flattering to the photo at all.', '2006-05-29 15:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466545, 339624, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks like a small figurine. It''s different than most other photos in the challenge, as they are of actual architecture, not a replica.</td>', 'This looks like a small figurine. It''s different than most other photos in the challenge, as they are of actual architecture, not a replica.', '2006-05-29 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466546, 339391, 43774, '<td valign="top">I just love those rotundas/domes that people keep posting in different challenges!!! I wish we had stunning architecture like this where I live. A 10 from me, this is very dramatic, B&amp;W works well.</td>', 'I just love those rotundas/domes that people keep posting in different challenges!!! I wish we had stunning architecture like this where I live. A 10 from me, this is very dramatic, B&W works well.', '2006-05-29 15:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466547, 339589, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice!! I love how the glass side almost disappears into the sky.</td>', 'Very nice!! I love how the glass side almost disappears into the sky.', '2006-05-29 16:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466549, 339041, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image looks a little soft. Not very fond of the angle and your blues look unnatural (over saturated maybe?)</td>', 'Image looks a little soft. Not very fond of the angle and your blues look unnatural (over saturated maybe?)', '2006-05-29 16:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466551, 338478, 16241, '<td valign="top">eye catching!</td>', 'eye catching!', '2006-05-29 16:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466553, 339641, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not fond of all the negative space. I''d prefer to see more of the building and less of the sky.</td>', 'Not fond of all the negative space. I''d prefer to see more of the building and less of the sky.', '2006-05-29 16:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466554, 339745, 16241, '<td valign="top">long drop!  works very well :)</td>', 'long drop!  works very well :)', '2006-05-29 16:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466558, 339006, 43774, '<td valign="top">The person just ruins this shot for me! It''s beautiful architecture and I like your photo except for the person.</td>', 'The person just ruins this shot for me! It''s beautiful architecture and I like your photo except for the person.', '2006-05-29 16:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
