(2466629, 339656, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  I like neon lighting effect and the memory card bridge.  Good luck on this one - nice take on the challenge!</td>', 'Very creative!  I like neon lighting effect and the memory card bridge.  Good luck on this one - nice take on the challenge!', '2006-05-29 16:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466636, 339701, 40019, '<td valign="top">Yep, recognized this fountain right away.  I was attending Purdue the year they built it! Nice image.  A little soft - most likely due to water and mist.  Good luck!</td>', 'Yep, recognized this fountain right away.  I was attending Purdue the year they built it! Nice image.  A little soft - most likely due to water and mist.  Good luck!', '2006-05-29 16:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466640, 339042, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool image!  The angles, lighting and reflection make for a very nice shot.  Good luck on this one!</td>', 'Very cool image!  The angles, lighting and reflection make for a very nice shot.  Good luck on this one!', '2006-05-29 16:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466643, 338942, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was taken through a dirty car window. Not sure what those blue streaks are but they do not enhance the photo.</td>', 'This looks like it was taken through a dirty car window. Not sure what those blue streaks are but they do not enhance the photo.', '2006-05-29 16:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466691, 339608, 57882, '<td valign="top">This is a pleasantly disruptive shot.  I think the somewhat cold tones here work well with the subject.</td>', 'This is a pleasantly disruptive shot.  I think the somewhat cold tones here work well with the subject.', '2006-05-29 16:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466701, 339743, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very good use of color contrast and good composition, but the postprocessing looks a bit sloppy (jagged edges and halos around the roofs).</td>', 'Very good use of color contrast and good composition, but the postprocessing looks a bit sloppy (jagged edges and halos around the roofs).', '2006-05-29 16:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466715, 339725, 7485, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and composition a lot, but that frame just about ruins the image for me. It''s not even symmetric, it''s thicker at the bottom. Also, if you have Photoshop, I think you could have pulled more detail out of the ceiling on the left with the Adjust--&gt;Shadows &amp; Highlights command.</td>', 'I like the perspective and composition a lot, but that frame just about ruins the image for me. It''s not even symmetric, it''s thicker at the bottom. Also, if you have Photoshop, I think you could have pulled more detail out of the ceiling on the left with the Adjust-->Shadows & Highlights command.', '2006-05-29 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466716, 339712, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the contrast is so high everywhere that the two people don''t stand out enough.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the contrast is so high everywhere that the two people don''t stand out enough.', '2006-05-29 17:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2466717, 339858, 7485, '<td valign="top">Looks like a frame straight out of a 1930''s film noir! Very nicely done, and a creative twist on this challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a frame straight out of a 1930''s film noir! Very nicely done, and a creative twist on this challenge.', '2006-05-29 17:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
