(2467328, 338599, 44579, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture, should have cropped the picture so that the side of the building is straight with the side of the frame. 6.<br/> <br/>At second glance, some weird optical illusion is going on here. I change to a 10.</td>', 'Awesome picture, should have cropped the picture so that the side of the building is straight with the side of the frame. 6. At second glance, some weird optical illusion is going on here. I change to a 10.', '2006-05-29 22:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
