(2467386, 339698, 35444, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but it is a little bland to me.  I threw it into photoshop and bumped up the contrast to +35 and put the brightness at -10 and it made for a richer photograph (IMO).  Lastly, the bricks on the lower right, I selected them did USM on them and the details became more clear.</td>', 'I really like this picture, but it is a little bland to me.  I threw it into photoshop and bumped up the contrast to +35 and put the brightness at -10 and it made for a richer photograph (IMO).  Lastly, the bricks on the lower right, I selected them did USM on them and the details became more clear.', '2006-05-29 23:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
