(2468011, 339168, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image is very dark which leaves very little detail.  Lower aperture or shutter would have given it more light.  Of course, then the sky would be overexposed.  Maybe an exposure adjustment in post processing would have been able to get more detail in the cabin.  Extract sky, then adjust brightness of shack.</td>', 'Image is very dark which leaves very little detail.  Lower aperture or shutter would have given it more light.  Of course, then the sky would be overexposed.  Maybe an exposure adjustment in post processing would have been able to get more detail in the cabin.  Extract sky, then adjust brightness of shack.', '2006-05-30 07:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468013, 338393, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very hazy shot.  Also very low contrast.  Sometimes things like polarizers or uv haze filters can add to sharpness and cut through some of the haze.</td>', 'Very hazy shot.  Also very low contrast.  Sometimes things like polarizers or uv haze filters can add to sharpness and cut through some of the haze.', '2006-05-30 07:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
