(2468642, 339292, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice selection of colors &amp; title.  It draws out warm feelings in me.  Thanks!</td>', 'Nice selection of colors & title.  It draws out warm feelings in me.  Thanks!', '2006-05-30 13:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468646, 339545, 55221, '<td valign="top">I like that your subject shows contrast while connecting itself; the pattern is difference from the normal windows and yet they are both of the same shape and size. Crisp, clear... contrasting colors. I would have enhanced contrast more.</td>', 'I like that your subject shows contrast while connecting itself; the pattern is difference from the normal windows and yet they are both of the same shape and size. Crisp, clear... contrasting colors. I would have enhanced contrast more.', '2006-05-30 13:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468647, 339866, 55221, '<td valign="top">Cool...</td>', 'Cool...', '2006-05-30 13:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468648, 339601, 55221, '<td valign="top">Creepy... the coloring makes it. I LOVE LOVE LOVE the sky and the blue windows against the slightly yellow building. Very nice</td>', 'Creepy... the coloring makes it. I LOVE LOVE LOVE the sky and the blue windows against the slightly yellow building. Very nice', '2006-05-30 13:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468650, 339432, 55221, '<td valign="top">Hahahahaha... like the subject. The vividness is nice.</td>', 'Hahahahaha... like the subject. The vividness is nice.', '2006-05-30 13:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468652, 339540, 55221, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern.</td>', 'Nice pattern.', '2006-05-30 13:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468653, 339827, 55221, '<td valign="top">Neat angle and sepia. Stairwells are some of my favorite subjects.</td>', 'Neat angle and sepia. Stairwells are some of my favorite subjects.', '2006-05-30 13:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468656, 339881, 58840, '<td valign="top">excellent shot.</td>', 'excellent shot.', '2006-05-30 13:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468658, 339589, 55221, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photograph! Wonderful job! You almost wonder which side is the reflection. Great job with the sky. I need you to teach me some of your tricks! Definately ribbon material!</td>', 'Brilliant photograph! Wonderful job! You almost wonder which side is the reflection. Great job with the sky. I need you to teach me some of your tricks! Definately ribbon material!', '2006-05-30 13:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468662, 339645, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>"Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges"</b>  This guide located under the pull-down window <b>Learn</b> will help you immensely with resizing issues, especially if you are having the same types of challenges I had when I first entered these contests.<br/>   I share that with you because of the lower scores you will consistently receive with entries that are only quarter-size.<br/>   Now with the critique of presentation over...Please be encouraged that I find this to be a very attractive red back-stop on a soccer field... apparently.  The strong red plays well against the mostly-green dappled background.  Kudos on being unique!  :)</td>', '"Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges"  This guide located under the pull-down window Learn will help you immensely with resizing issues, especially if you are having the same types of challenges I had when I first entered these contests.   I share that with you because of the lower scores you will consistently receive with entries that are only quarter-size.   Now with the critique of presentation over...Please be encouraged that I find this to be a very attractive red back-stop on a soccer field... apparently.  The strong red plays well against the mostly-green dappled background.  Kudos on being unique!  :)', '2006-05-30 13:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468663, 339712, 58840, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2006-05-30 13:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468668, 339240, 58840, '<td valign="top">very creative use of composition.</td>', 'very creative use of composition.', '2006-05-30 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2468669, 339432, 50034, '<td valign="top">Truly "Beauty is in the Eyes of the Beholder"...for those who have eyes to see it.  And I <b>do</b> see the beauty!!!!  Thanks for sharing it!  :)<br/>   Just a bit more contrast between subject (house) &amp; background (trees) and it would have been a 10 from me.  However, I give you an 8 over-all.</td>', 'Truly "Beauty is in the Eyes of the Beholder"...for those who have eyes to see it.  And I do see the beauty!!!!  Thanks for sharing it!  :)   Just a bit more contrast between subject (house) & background (trees) and it would have been a 10 from me.  However, I give you an 8 over-all.', '2006-05-30 13:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
