(2469437, 339159, 30982, '<td valign="top">If I''d sent you on assignment to take a shot of the capitol to highlight the architecture, this would be exactly what I''d want to see.  The clarity, especially for a night shot, is stunning, and the composition and exposure are dead on.  The framing at the bottom with the trees, though, is what truly completes the picture.  It''s classic and it''s gorgeous!</td>', 'If I''d sent you on assignment to take a shot of the capitol to highlight the architecture, this would be exactly what I''d want to see.  The clarity, especially for a night shot, is stunning, and the composition and exposure are dead on.  The framing at the bottom with the trees, though, is what truly completes the picture.  It''s classic and it''s gorgeous!', '2006-05-30 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
