(2469514, 339544, 7628, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge - so unusual in composition and color.  I especially enjoy the abstract quality of the image, while it is still very structural.  The image makes us see like an achitect - form and fuction.  And obviously the environment adds an extra special quality. 10</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge - so unusual in composition and color.  I especially enjoy the abstract quality of the image, while it is still very structural.  The image makes us see like an achitect - form and fuction.  And obviously the environment adds an extra special quality. 10', '2006-05-30 21:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469515, 339145, 33352, '<td valign="top">Did the clouds square off for this image....6</td>', 'Did the clouds square off for this image....6', '2006-05-30 21:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469517, 339391, 33352, '<td valign="top">This coloring is strange, but very good,the capture of the dome architecture stands out,this gets my top shelf vote....10</td>', 'This coloring is strange, but very good,the capture of the dome architecture stands out,this gets my top shelf vote....10', '2006-05-30 21:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469518, 339880, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how this image seems to spin while remaining very solid - a result of the excellent composition and great sky - good work with exposure!  This is simple yet meaningful. 9</td>', 'I like how this image seems to spin while remaining very solid - a result of the excellent composition and great sky - good work with exposure!  This is simple yet meaningful. 9', '2006-05-30 21:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469523, 339421, 7628, '<td valign="top">How wonderful how the spot of blue sky lined up with the swoop of the roof - good eye!  I like the red and the blue - so bright and contrasty -yet second to the fabulous white shapes on the roof.  Very dynamic composition.  Great exposure, focus... 9</td>', 'How wonderful how the spot of blue sky lined up with the swoop of the roof - good eye!  I like the red and the blue - so bright and contrasty -yet second to the fabulous white shapes on the roof.  Very dynamic composition.  Great exposure, focus... 9', '2006-05-30 21:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469524, 338570, 30669, '<td valign="top">An interesting, different perspective on this.</td>', 'An interesting, different perspective on this.', '2006-05-30 21:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
