(2469535, 339580, 18870, '<td valign="top">this is by far the best of the challenge.... and possibly one of the best bridge shots i''ve seen.  I love it.  fantastic shot!  10.</td>', 'this is by far the best of the challenge.... and possibly one of the best bridge shots i''ve seen.  I love it.  fantastic shot!  10.', '2006-05-30 21:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
