(2469539, 338984, 7628, '<td valign="top">A quality moody Icelandic shot.  With the burning and extra attention to texture you have captured the essense of Arbaer Museum, historical Icelandic achitecture.  The symetry works very well. I like how the green door catches up the color of the grass and moss.  The bits of burning that come down into the blue sky are a bit odd and distracting - perhaps you went a bit too far.</td>', 'A quality moody Icelandic shot.  With the burning and extra attention to texture you have captured the essense of Arbaer Museum, historical Icelandic achitecture.  The symetry works very well. I like how the green door catches up the color of the grass and moss.  The bits of burning that come down into the blue sky are a bit odd and distracting - perhaps you went a bit too far.', '2006-05-30 21:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469544, 338738, 58235, '<td valign="top">this is surreal and the colors are awesome<br/>the top tower portion looks a little fuzzy but otherwise i can hardly find<br/>a complaint. id give it a ten if i could vote<br/>it almost looks fake.</td>', 'this is surreal and the colors are awesomethe top tower portion looks a little fuzzy but otherwise i can hardly finda complaint. id give it a ten if i could voteit almost looks fake.', '2006-05-30 21:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469546, 339633, 7628, '<td valign="top">Excellent juxtiposition of sky and subject - the way the clouds spin out from the peak of the roof.  Good use of the thirds rule.  It seems a bit dark - perhaps a bit more contrast, but then again - it is very Icelandic light. 8</td>', 'Excellent juxtiposition of sky and subject - the way the clouds spin out from the peak of the roof.  Good use of the thirds rule.  It seems a bit dark - perhaps a bit more contrast, but then again - it is very Icelandic light. 8', '2006-05-30 21:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469547, 339672, 58235, '<td valign="top">the aged/almost antique feel this photo has is nice and unique</td>', 'the aged/almost antique feel this photo has is nice and unique', '2006-05-30 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469550, 339747, 58235, '<td valign="top">pretty but i personally would have prefered it more centered<br/>but thats just an opinion</td>', 'pretty but i personally would have prefered it more centeredbut thats just an opinion', '2006-05-30 21:24:23.000000', NULL, 1);
