(2469576, 339743, 37893, '<td valign="top">Back for comments.<br/> <br/>Hello Brian. The processing on this image is slightly distracting as edge halos appear around the roof of the building. This doesn''t appear to be natural. Your outtake is far better in terms of the processing of the skies. However, what does work for this one is the color you''ve chosen to render the building itself. The clouds are amazing. I love angry clouds such as this but the editing leaves me a bit on edge. Good luck.</td>', 'Back for comments. Hello Brian. The processing on this image is slightly distracting as edge halos appear around the roof of the building. This doesn''t appear to be natural. Your outtake is far better in terms of the processing of the skies. However, what does work for this one is the color you''ve chosen to render the building itself. The clouds are amazing. I love angry clouds such as this but the editing leaves me a bit on edge. Good luck.', '2006-05-30 21:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
