(2469642, 339645, 36141, '<td valign="top">Gees, it''s so small, you''ll get hammered for that I guess. Still, I like it, it''s different and I like out of the box photos.7</td>', 'Gees, it''s so small, you''ll get hammered for that I guess. Still, I like it, it''s different and I like out of the box photos.7', '2006-05-30 21:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
