(2469650, 339877, 36141, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of a building in The Netherlands, in Assen, but I could be dead wrong of course. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Makes me think of a building in The Netherlands, in Assen, but I could be dead wrong of course. Very nice photo.', '2006-05-30 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469660, 339580, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wow talk about moving the viewer eye into the frame!  The bridge function to transport out eye across the frame to the city - nice composition.  Great exposure and colors and reflections! Bumping up. 9</td>', 'Wow talk about moving the viewer eye into the frame!  The bridge function to transport out eye across the frame to the city - nice composition.  Great exposure and colors and reflections! Bumping up. 9', '2006-05-30 22:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469665, 339499, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun color, simple composition - makes the viewer look close at the texture and shape of the structure and get the most out of it.  Burning in that dash of clouds might add a little drama.  The bright burnt out reflection is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Fun color, simple composition - makes the viewer look close at the texture and shape of the structure and get the most out of it.  Burning in that dash of clouds might add a little drama.  The bright burnt out reflection is a bit distracting.', '2006-05-30 22:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469676, 339589, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun play on the eye - which is sky and which is building? What is building and what is reflection? Nice contrast and color - hint of dark blue.</td>', 'Fun play on the eye - which is sky and which is building? What is building and what is reflection? Nice contrast and color - hint of dark blue.', '2006-05-30 22:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2469677, 338655, 36141, '<td valign="top">Pity you left the blue boats in, they''re very distracting.<br/>Without them I would''ve rated it very, very high.</td>', 'Pity you left the blue boats in, they''re very distracting.Without them I would''ve rated it very, very high.', '2006-05-30 22:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
