(2469740, 339478, 30982, '<td valign="top">The picture is a bit noisy, and the surface tension of water isn''t quite strong enough to form droplets that big which makes it a bit unrealistic to me.  Interesting idea, though!</td>', 'The picture is a bit noisy, and the surface tension of water isn''t quite strong enough to form droplets that big which makes it a bit unrealistic to me.  Interesting idea, though!', '2006-05-30 22:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
