(2469744, 339617, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like the use of contrasts here but the photographic contrast needs to be a bit stronger.  Depending on what color the foreground tower is, it might also work in selective desat, with the background building left in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I do like the use of contrasts here but the photographic contrast needs to be a bit stronger.  Depending on what color the foreground tower is, it might also work in selective desat, with the background building left in B&W.', '2006-05-30 22:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
