(2471065, 339624, 12733, '<td valign="top">At first glance I said, "what a strange house." Then I looked at the tree and it changed to "what an overprocessed photograph." As a work of art I can enjoy this, but one of the rules states that processing should not change the essentially photographic quality of the image.</td>', 'At first glance I said, "what a strange house." Then I looked at the tree and it changed to "what an overprocessed photograph." As a work of art I can enjoy this, but one of the rules states that processing should not change the essentially photographic quality of the image.', '2006-05-31 08:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471066, 339426, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and reflections.</td>', 'Great lighting and reflections.', '2006-05-31 08:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471067, 339675, 12733, '<td valign="top">The golden light on this building is lovely.</td>', 'The golden light on this building is lovely.', '2006-05-31 08:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471070, 339043, 12733, '<td valign="top">There really isn''t enough of the dome to sense its roundness or to appreciate the effect of a gable on this shape.</td>', 'There really isn''t enough of the dome to sense its roundness or to appreciate the effect of a gable on this shape.', '2006-05-31 08:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471073, 338652, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like worn brick, and this is enhanced with greenery. The high vantage point creates an interesting composition.</td>', 'I really like worn brick, and this is enhanced with greenery. The high vantage point creates an interesting composition.', '2006-05-31 08:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471078, 339721, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a nice rendition of a proliferating form of American architecture. The overall photo is darker that I would have liked.</td>', 'This is a nice rendition of a proliferating form of American architecture. The overall photo is darker that I would have liked.', '2006-05-31 08:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471080, 339116, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great color and brightness.</td>', 'Great color and brightness.', '2006-05-31 08:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471082, 339269, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of lines, shapes, colors.</td>', 'Nice combination of lines, shapes, colors.', '2006-05-31 08:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471090, 339322, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s a beutiful bridge, but the flare over the forward tower blows the effect.</td>', 'It''s a beutiful bridge, but the flare over the forward tower blows the effect.', '2006-05-31 08:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471091, 339837, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting building and photo, but it''s too busy for my taste.</td>', 'This is an interesting building and photo, but it''s too busy for my taste.', '2006-05-31 08:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471093, 338461, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting building and angle. The dark mood seems to make a statement about city life.</td>', 'Interesting building and angle. The dark mood seems to make a statement about city life.', '2006-05-31 08:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471096, 339868, 12733, '<td valign="top">This photo brings out the brilliant lines and colors of the building. I think it would have been stronger if the disttracting building at the bottom had bee cropped out.</td>', 'This photo brings out the brilliant lines and colors of the building. I think it would have been stronger if the disttracting building at the bottom had bee cropped out.', '2006-05-31 08:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471099, 339283, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of converging verticals - usually considered a flaw - to create an interesting composition.</td>', 'Nice use of converging verticals - usually considered a flaw - to create an interesting composition.', '2006-05-31 08:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471102, 339237, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but the building is too dark to see any detail.</td>', 'Nice sky, but the building is too dark to see any detail.', '2006-05-31 08:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471104, 338393, 12733, '<td valign="top">Are you saying the small, shadowy builing in the foreground is the subject of this picture? I find the overall image too busy for my taste.</td>', 'Are you saying the small, shadowy builing in the foreground is the subject of this picture? I find the overall image too busy for my taste.', '2006-05-31 08:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471106, 339617, 23430, '<td valign="top">The front building looks a little soft on focus. Other than that I like the composition of the shot and I like how you''ve filled the background with the new building. It''s great.</td>', 'The front building looks a little soft on focus. Other than that I like the composition of the shot and I like how you''ve filled the background with the new building. It''s great.', '2006-05-31 08:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471108, 339387, 12733, '<td valign="top">Really humble - there''s not much homestead left! Nice capture on the texture of the logs.</td>', 'Really humble - there''s not much homestead left! Nice capture on the texture of the logs.', '2006-05-31 08:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471112, 339421, 23430, '<td valign="top">This is truly a shot of architecture. The cloud and sky is spot on as well.</td>', 'This is truly a shot of architecture. The cloud and sky is spot on as well.', '2006-05-31 08:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471123, 338956, 23430, '<td valign="top">This is the best shot Ive seen of this structure. I think the light is hitting it at a good angle. Going from corner to corner of your frame is good. I think your frame improves this too.</td>', 'This is the best shot Ive seen of this structure. I think the light is hitting it at a good angle. Going from corner to corner of your frame is good. I think your frame improves this too.', '2006-05-31 08:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471132, 339124, 23430, '<td valign="top">This looks surreal, futuristic. The water, the grey pillars and especially the patterned reflections on the pillars look fantastic. Lighting and exposure is spot on.</td>', 'This looks surreal, futuristic. The water, the grey pillars and especially the patterned reflections on the pillars look fantastic. Lighting and exposure is spot on.', '2006-05-31 08:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471134, 339211, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good lighting showing the great form of this building.</td>', 'Good lighting showing the great form of this building.', '2006-05-31 08:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471160, 339671, 38032, '<td valign="top">dramatic and unique - I want this lens. 8</td>', 'dramatic and unique - I want this lens. 8', '2006-05-31 08:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471164, 338283, 38032, '<td valign="top">Like the metallic and the effect in the photo.  The sky and angle (rotation) could be adjusted for a more holistically pleasing image. 6</td>', 'Like the metallic and the effect in the photo.  The sky and angle (rotation) could be adjusted for a more holistically pleasing image. 6', '2006-05-31 08:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471166, 338990, 38032, '<td valign="top">Good eye for composition.</td>', 'Good eye for composition.', '2006-05-31 08:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471173, 339589, 38032, '<td valign="top">That is an awesome reflection and powerful effect.  I think the eye is semi-consciously surprised by the fact that that''s a building (and not just clouds)  which makes for a very pleasing view.  Added to my faves.</td>', 'That is an awesome reflection and powerful effect.  I think the eye is semi-consciously surprised by the fact that that''s a building (and not just clouds)  which makes for a very pleasing view.  Added to my faves.', '2006-05-31 09:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
