(2471214, 339656, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like it ...The glow is cool too. I can''t tell whether it''s topo or from the side though.  7</td>', 'I like it ...The glow is cool too. I can''t tell whether it''s topo or from the side though.  7', '2006-05-31 09:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
