(2471335, 339711, 40355, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the warm colors of the building and the cool sky.  The lights overexposed in spots, but in this case, it almost works - if it had been toned down just a bit, it would be perfect.  Overall, great shot.  8</td>', 'Great contrast between the warm colors of the building and the cool sky.  The lights overexposed in spots, but in this case, it almost works - if it had been toned down just a bit, it would be perfect.  Overall, great shot.  8', '2006-05-31 10:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471339, 339725, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is interesting (as were the looks you got lying on the floor to take it, I suspect!).  The mirror effect adds some great depth vertically, to compliment the horizontal depth.  Well shot! 8</td>', 'This is interesting (as were the looks you got lying on the floor to take it, I suspect!).  The mirror effect adds some great depth vertically, to compliment the horizontal depth.  Well shot! 8', '2006-05-31 10:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471345, 339282, 40355, '<td valign="top">The tower would be a unusual bit of architecture, but IMO, the shot is too open, and the eye drifts to the beach, and especially to the barge and oil rig in the background.</td>', 'The tower would be a unusual bit of architecture, but IMO, the shot is too open, and the eye drifts to the beach, and especially to the barge and oil rig in the background.', '2006-05-31 10:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471348, 338478, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very unusual building, great shot for this challenge.  I like how you included the stairways, they add some good detail and depth to the shot.  7</td>', 'Very unusual building, great shot for this challenge.  I like how you included the stairways, they add some good detail and depth to the shot.  7', '2006-05-31 10:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471350, 339792, 49326, '<td valign="top">You could have gotten a lot better shot of this house than that. I don''t like seeing the other houses in the background. I think it''s a too complicated composition. Try to make it simple next time. 5 for being Icelandic :)</td>', 'You could have gotten a lot better shot of this house than that. I don''t like seeing the other houses in the background. I think it''s a too complicated composition. Try to make it simple next time. 5 for being Icelandic :)', '2006-05-31 10:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471351, 338862, 40355, '<td valign="top">The green is neat, but I have a hard time getting a sense of where I am/what I''m looking at here.  It''s a bit confusing.</td>', 'The green is neat, but I have a hard time getting a sense of where I am/what I''m looking at here.  It''s a bit confusing.', '2006-05-31 10:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471356, 339668, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  The softness of the columns vs. the sharpness of the windows really lends contrast, as does the mix of colors.  I hope to see this on the homepage in a week!  10</td>', 'This is a great shot!  The softness of the columns vs. the sharpness of the windows really lends contrast, as does the mix of colors.  I hope to see this on the homepage in a week!  10', '2006-05-31 10:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471358, 338506, 40355, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good use of the trees to frame the shot.  The blurred leaves on the right are a bit distracting, but hey, it happens.  My only complaint is that the dome looks crooked, leaning a bit to the right.</td>', 'Nice lighting, good use of the trees to frame the shot.  The blurred leaves on the right are a bit distracting, but hey, it happens.  My only complaint is that the dome looks crooked, leaning a bit to the right.', '2006-05-31 10:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471364, 339787, 40355, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle to shoot from.  Most shots of such places seem to be of just the building - I really like how you included the stairs and all - gives a much better sense of place.  9</td>', 'Unusual angle to shoot from.  Most shots of such places seem to be of just the building - I really like how you included the stairs and all - gives a much better sense of place.  9', '2006-05-31 10:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471367, 339421, 40355, '<td valign="top">Great choice of buildings, the sweeping architecture leads the eye through the shot.  The contrast between the dark sky and red in the windows is a real boost, too.  7</td>', 'Great choice of buildings, the sweeping architecture leads the eye through the shot.  The contrast between the dark sky and red in the windows is a real boost, too.  7', '2006-05-31 10:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471373, 339608, 40355, '<td valign="top">Looking at this makes me a little dizzy, almost like it''s going to fall on me.  Maybe could brightened the building a bit, but otherwise a solid shot.</td>', 'Looking at this makes me a little dizzy, almost like it''s going to fall on me.  Maybe could brightened the building a bit, but otherwise a solid shot.', '2006-05-31 10:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471375, 339603, 40355, '<td valign="top">Good choice for a B&amp;W shot, exposure looks spot-on to me.</td>', 'Good choice for a B&W shot, exposure looks spot-on to me.', '2006-05-31 10:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471396, 339253, 40355, '<td valign="top">Love the faded-edge border, goes well with the shot.  (I''d like to know how you did it, actually!)  The shot itself looks great in B&amp;W, well balanced and exposed.  8</td>', 'Love the faded-edge border, goes well with the shot.  (I''d like to know how you did it, actually!)  The shot itself looks great in B&W, well balanced and exposed.  8', '2006-05-31 10:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471399, 339879, 40355, '<td valign="top">Angle makes the building look like it''s going to fall over.  Maybe level it, at least a little, next time.</td>', 'Angle makes the building look like it''s going to fall over.  Maybe level it, at least a little, next time.', '2006-05-31 10:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471402, 339861, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is very busy - the eye gets lost/confused in it, especially the background.</td>', 'This is very busy - the eye gets lost/confused in it, especially the background.', '2006-05-31 10:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471404, 339385, 40355, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the windows make the shot.  Great capture!</td>', 'The reflections in the windows make the shot.  Great capture!', '2006-05-31 10:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471406, 338984, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very moody, the combination of dark, cool colors.  The stright-on perspective works well here!  10</td>', 'Very moody, the combination of dark, cool colors.  The stright-on perspective works well here!  10', '2006-05-31 10:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471411, 339376, 40355, '<td valign="top">The blown sky takes away from the overall impact, sorry.</td>', 'The blown sky takes away from the overall impact, sorry.', '2006-05-31 10:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471414, 339866, 40355, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually fond of radical angles in architecture shots, but this one really works!  Great colors and shadows.  Maybe a ribbon in your future? ;-)  10</td>', 'I''m not usually fond of radical angles in architecture shots, but this one really works!  Great colors and shadows.  Maybe a ribbon in your future? ;-)  10', '2006-05-31 10:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471420, 339704, 40355, '<td valign="top">Good idea to use selective desaturation.  It''s a bit harsh and abrupt, though.  Perhaps it would have been less so if you had left just a hint of color, 10% or so?</td>', 'Good idea to use selective desaturation.  It''s a bit harsh and abrupt, though.  Perhaps it would have been less so if you had left just a hint of color, 10% or so?', '2006-05-31 10:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471425, 338390, 40355, '<td valign="top">Curious, why''d you cut off her feet?  The angel dominates so much of the shot that, IMO, it would have been better to zoom out just enough to include all of her in the shot, and still have the architecture in the background, too.</td>', 'Curious, why''d you cut off her feet?  The angel dominates so much of the shot that, IMO, it would have been better to zoom out just enough to include all of her in the shot, and still have the architecture in the background, too.', '2006-05-31 10:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471428, 339269, 40355, '<td valign="top">Indeed a dazzling design, with well-placed splashes of color.  Well shot!  9</td>', 'Indeed a dazzling design, with well-placed splashes of color.  Well shot!  9', '2006-05-31 10:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471435, 339168, 40355, '<td valign="top">This has real potential, especially since subject-wise, it shows the opposite end of the usual specturm - shacks instead of skyscrapers and palaces.  However, it''s just a bit too dark.  A slightly longer exposure would have done wonders, I think.</td>', 'This has real potential, especially since subject-wise, it shows the opposite end of the usual specturm - shacks instead of skyscrapers and palaces.  However, it''s just a bit too dark.  A slightly longer exposure would have done wonders, I think.', '2006-05-31 10:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471437, 339616, 40355, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but IMO, a bit tighter crop would have helped.</td>', 'Good shot, but IMO, a bit tighter crop would have helped.', '2006-05-31 10:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471441, 339645, 40355, '<td valign="top">The image is tiny!  Which is a shame, because it''s interesting, but we can''t get a real good look at it.</td>', 'The image is tiny!  Which is a shame, because it''s interesting, but we can''t get a real good look at it.', '2006-05-31 10:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471444, 339642, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but it comes out with too much white space.  Even if there were brick lines or something, it would work better - but too much is just blown white.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but it comes out with too much white space.  Even if there were brick lines or something, it would work better - but too much is just blown white.', '2006-05-31 10:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471454, 339663, 40355, '<td valign="top">The bird near the top actually takes away from the overall image.</td>', 'The bird near the top actually takes away from the overall image.', '2006-05-31 10:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471455, 339869, 40355, '<td valign="top">Simple, but elegent.</td>', 'Simple, but elegent.', '2006-05-31 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471463, 339292, 40355, '<td valign="top">I will be VERY surprised if you don''t get a ribbon for this.  Amazing shot, the range of colors.  Nice placement of the flare.  Just beautiful.  10</td>', 'I will be VERY surprised if you don''t get a ribbon for this.  Amazing shot, the range of colors.  Nice placement of the flare.  Just beautiful.  10', '2006-05-31 10:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471466, 339478, 40355, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Someone has a good sense of humor.</td>', 'Cute.  Someone has a good sense of humor.', '2006-05-31 10:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471479, 339098, 40355, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing for this challenge.  It''s neat to see a building with work being done on it.  Very well shot.  10</td>', 'Perfect timing for this challenge.  It''s neat to see a building with work being done on it.  Very well shot.  10', '2006-05-31 10:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471482, 339540, 33672, '<td valign="top">A sharper image of this capture and perspective would be a ribbon contender. nice comp amd shadows.</td>', 'A sharper image of this capture and perspective would be a ribbon contender. nice comp amd shadows.', '2006-05-31 10:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471485, 339656, 40355, '<td valign="top">Out of the box, for sure.  But very interesting to study.</td>', 'Out of the box, for sure.  But very interesting to study.', '2006-05-31 10:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471494, 339513, 40355, '<td valign="top">Covered bridges are hard to shoot!  It''s a bit dark, and the top of your sky is blowing out.  Sunrise and sunset are supposed to be the best times to try this sort of shot.  It''s too bad there''s no way to get rid of the sign, as it''s reflection is also distracting.</td>', 'Covered bridges are hard to shoot!  It''s a bit dark, and the top of your sky is blowing out.  Sunrise and sunset are supposed to be the best times to try this sort of shot.  It''s too bad there''s no way to get rid of the sign, as it''s reflection is also distracting.', '2006-05-31 10:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471498, 339589, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s all I have to say, just wow.  10</td>', 'Wow!  That''s all I have to say, just wow.  10', '2006-05-31 10:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471506, 338281, 40355, '<td valign="top">Nice departure from the standard city shots that are so common in this challenge.  You''ve done a good job captureing the essence of the country.  Maybe clone out the power lines?</td>', 'Nice departure from the standard city shots that are so common in this challenge.  You''ve done a good job captureing the essence of the country.  Maybe clone out the power lines?', '2006-05-31 10:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471514, 339124, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is great.  Love the silvers and yellow, the water reflections.  Very well done!  10</td>', 'This is great.  Love the silvers and yellow, the water reflections.  Very well done!  10', '2006-05-31 10:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471516, 338826, 40355, '<td valign="top">Ironic</td>', 'Ironic', '2006-05-31 10:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471519, 339544, 40355, '<td valign="top">Moody, like something out of a suspense film.  Very cool!  9</td>', 'Moody, like something out of a suspense film.  Very cool!  9', '2006-05-31 10:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471524, 339322, 40355, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad that red cloud is over the near tower.  Otherwise, a nearly perfect shot!  8</td>', 'It''s too bad that red cloud is over the near tower.  Otherwise, a nearly perfect shot!  8', '2006-05-31 11:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471527, 339621, 40355, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the kind I''d hang on the wall.  Good luck!  10</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the kind I''d hang on the wall.  Good luck!  10', '2006-05-31 11:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471579, 339094, 208, '<td valign="top">The colors are very rich, but overall, they look too much like a watercolor painting for my tastes. Also, the bridge seems to be lost along the treeline; the sky and its reflection seem to be the centerpiece of this shot instead of the bridge.</td>', 'The colors are very rich, but overall, they look too much like a watercolor painting for my tastes. Also, the bridge seems to be lost along the treeline; the sky and its reflection seem to be the centerpiece of this shot instead of the bridge.', '2006-05-31 11:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471591, 339282, 208, '<td valign="top">You almost have a nice line with the rig, tower, and planter. The colors are nice. That''s sort of my overall impression of this shot: nice, but nothing extraordinarily special.</td>', 'You almost have a nice line with the rig, tower, and planter. The colors are nice. That''s sort of my overall impression of this shot: nice, but nothing extraordinarily special.', '2006-05-31 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471601, 339432, 208, '<td valign="top">heh. Nice capture. Colors seem a bit oversaturated.</td>', 'heh. Nice capture. Colors seem a bit oversaturated.', '2006-05-31 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471618, 339455, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice, dramatic black &amp; white that fits the building''s style. I might have tilted down a bit to get the bottom of the door &amp; pillars even if that sacrificed some of that cool sky. (And "Speed the Plow" is a good play.)</td>', 'Nice, dramatic black & white that fits the building''s style. I might have tilted down a bit to get the bottom of the door & pillars even if that sacrificed some of that cool sky. (And "Speed the Plow" is a good play.)', '2006-05-31 11:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471626, 338506, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice natural framing and pretty colors. This would look good in a brochure.</td>', 'Nice natural framing and pretty colors. This would look good in a brochure.', '2006-05-31 11:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471636, 339098, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The tower seems a little washed out; the statues and the column blend into the clouds. Overall, I like the composition and the hard black lines of the underside of the scaffolding.</td>', 'Nice shot. The tower seems a little washed out; the statues and the column blend into the clouds. Overall, I like the composition and the hard black lines of the underside of the scaffolding.', '2006-05-31 11:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471643, 339775, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well composed. For an "architecture" challenge, you might want to concentrate more on the lighthouse than the foreground.</td>', 'Nice shot, well composed. For an "architecture" challenge, you might want to concentrate more on the lighthouse than the foreground.', '2006-05-31 11:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471652, 338748, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the hard lines of the bridge versus the trees. Too bad the sky didn''t help you out much; the shot could use some "pop."</td>', 'I like the contrast of the hard lines of the bridge versus the trees. Too bad the sky didn''t help you out much; the shot could use some "pop."', '2006-05-31 11:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471661, 338599, 208, '<td valign="top">I have the uncomfortable feeling the building is leaning to the left, but I can''t prove it. Nice crisp colors. The small pyramid is a good touch.</td>', 'I have the uncomfortable feeling the building is leaning to the left, but I can''t prove it. Nice crisp colors. The small pyramid is a good touch.', '2006-05-31 11:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471671, 339624, 208, '<td valign="top">The "cottage" feels a little cramped on the left, especially (I think) with all that space up top. Overall, it''s nice and crisp. Clever idea.</td>', 'The "cottage" feels a little cramped on the left, especially (I think) with all that space up top. Overall, it''s nice and crisp. Clever idea.', '2006-05-31 11:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471677, 339878, 208, '<td valign="top">This is very cool. Great dramatic lines and colors.</td>', 'This is very cool. Great dramatic lines and colors.', '2006-05-31 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471684, 338628, 208, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful, but oversaturated for my taste. The building is impressive enough without the extra help.</td>', 'The colors are beautiful, but oversaturated for my taste. The building is impressive enough without the extra help.', '2006-05-31 11:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471688, 338493, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice lines on the roof (good catch), but the overall lighting is kind of drab.</td>', 'Nice lines on the roof (good catch), but the overall lighting is kind of drab.', '2006-05-31 11:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471700, 339259, 208, '<td valign="top">A bit of distortion on the edges competes slightly with the strong straight lines of the pews and columns, but not quite enough to hurt the overall impact. Nice, clean shot.</td>', 'A bit of distortion on the edges competes slightly with the strong straight lines of the pews and columns, but not quite enough to hurt the overall impact. Nice, clean shot.', '2006-05-31 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471714, 339739, 208, '<td valign="top">This is cool. With the extreme lighting, it looks like an artist''s conception drawing. Lots of personality in this shot - colors, angles, detail at the bottom. Well done all round.</td>', 'This is cool. With the extreme lighting, it looks like an artist''s conception drawing. Lots of personality in this shot - colors, angles, detail at the bottom. Well done all round.', '2006-05-31 11:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471718, 339877, 208, '<td valign="top">A bit too much pink for my taste - you can see it in the sky, even where it''s clearly blue. But if you were going for the style of one of those old postcards, you got it.</td>', 'A bit too much pink for my taste - you can see it in the sky, even where it''s clearly blue. But if you were going for the style of one of those old postcards, you got it.', '2006-05-31 11:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471724, 339842, 208, '<td valign="top">Not sure the lens flare works here. The tub has plenty of character on its own; why distract from it? The contrast of the tub vs nature is nice, maybe highlight that more.</td>', 'Not sure the lens flare works here. The tub has plenty of character on its own; why distract from it? The contrast of the tub vs nature is nice, maybe highlight that more.', '2006-05-31 11:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471729, 339420, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of color and style.</td>', 'Nice contrast of color and style.', '2006-05-31 11:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471733, 339673, 208, '<td valign="top">Knoxville? The reflection at the top of the sphere blends a bit much with the white cloud. Blue or gray sky might have worked better in that corner. I''m sure you''ll get right on that.</td>', 'Knoxville? The reflection at the top of the sphere blends a bit much with the white cloud. Blue or gray sky might have worked better in that corner. I''m sure you''ll get right on that.', '2006-05-31 11:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471738, 339870, 208, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad there''s something interesting at the end of those lines. Nice job controlling the light - the end isn''t overexposed, but we can still see details up front.</td>', 'I''m so glad there''s something interesting at the end of those lines. Nice job controlling the light - the end isn''t overexposed, but we can still see details up front.', '2006-05-31 11:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471746, 339852, 208, '<td valign="top">A straight-on shot like this becomes all about the subject, and that is one ugly building. A good photo to put in a travel album.</td>', 'A straight-on shot like this becomes all about the subject, and that is one ugly building. A good photo to put in a travel album.', '2006-05-31 11:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471749, 339159, 208, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail, nice work with the light. (Why is the flag at half-staff?)</td>', 'Beautiful detail, nice work with the light. (Why is the flag at half-staff?)', '2006-05-31 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471756, 339691, 208, '<td valign="top">A nice shot for a travel album. Good crop not cutting of the couple''s feet.</td>', 'A nice shot for a travel album. Good crop not cutting of the couple''s feet.', '2006-05-31 11:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471771, 339646, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool curves and lines.</td>', 'Cool curves and lines.', '2006-05-31 11:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471774, 338956, 208, '<td valign="top">Well done. Nice composition and contrast. Very dramatic shot.</td>', 'Well done. Nice composition and contrast. Very dramatic shot.', '2006-05-31 12:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471876, 339560, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast. However, it seems a bit over saturated over sharpened. I like the comp and the cool sky.</td>', 'Interesting contrast. However, it seems a bit over saturated over sharpened. I like the comp and the cool sky.', '2006-05-31 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471884, 339600, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like this photo because it has quite a bit of depth that gives it an extra 3D feel</td>', 'I like this photo because it has quite a bit of depth that gives it an extra 3D feel', '2006-05-31 12:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471999, 339426, 49542, '<td valign="top">this is utterly stunning!  i feel like i''ve been taken back in time.  wonderful photo!</td>', 'this is utterly stunning!  i feel like i''ve been taken back in time.  wonderful photo!', '2006-05-31 13:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472067, 339663, 17503, '<td valign="top">Noticable barrel distortion...oh well, wide angle lenses have pro''s and con''s!</td>', 'Noticable barrel distortion...oh well, wide angle lenses have pro''s and con''s!', '2006-05-31 13:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472074, 338689, 17503, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the foreground balustrade to prevent the distraction I suffered...nice reflection though.</td>', 'I would have cropped the foreground balustrade to prevent the distraction I suffered...nice reflection though.', '2006-05-31 13:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472112, 339698, 51538, '<td valign="top">Colours and forms are beautiful on this one.  The light is excellent.  BY the way, I like the frame as well.</td>', 'Colours and forms are beautiful on this one.  The light is excellent.  BY the way, I like the frame as well.', '2006-05-31 13:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472114, 339583, 51538, '<td valign="top">I know it well.  Though I live in NYC my family lives close by Arundel.  Very nice rendition.</td>', 'I know it well.  Though I live in NYC my family lives close by Arundel.  Very nice rendition.', '2006-05-31 13:33:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2472116, 339871, 51538, '<td valign="top">Excellent form and detail.  Colours are great.</td>', 'Excellent form and detail.  Colours are great.', '2006-05-31 13:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472117, 339843, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the challenge.  Nice tones.</td>', 'One of my favourites of the challenge.  Nice tones.', '2006-05-31 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472119, 339421, 51538, '<td valign="top">Great colours.</td>', 'Great colours.', '2006-05-31 13:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472120, 339816, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A strong visual metaphor.</td>', 'Very nice.  A strong visual metaphor.', '2006-05-31 13:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472122, 339608, 51538, '<td valign="top">Marvelous drama in this photo.  Colours are wonderful too.</td>', 'Marvelous drama in this photo.  Colours are wonderful too.', '2006-05-31 13:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472123, 338554, 51538, '<td valign="top">Like the valley line going out to the horizon.</td>', 'Like the valley line going out to the horizon.', '2006-05-31 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472125, 339464, 51538, '<td valign="top">In a stock photo album I can see it listed under science, industry, perhaps design.  But, as you suggest, it is a form of architecture.</td>', 'In a stock photo album I can see it listed under science, industry, perhaps design.  But, as you suggest, it is a form of architecture.', '2006-05-31 13:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472126, 339387, 51538, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the colours could have been boosted with a little processing.  The image is very nice and has some sort of unrealized potential.</td>', 'Perhaps the colours could have been boosted with a little processing.  The image is very nice and has some sort of unrealized potential.', '2006-05-31 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472127, 337648, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pleasing colours.  Might have cropped the bottom a little.</td>', 'Pleasing colours.  Might have cropped the bottom a little.', '2006-05-31 13:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472129, 339118, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but highly effective.</td>', 'Simple but highly effective.', '2006-05-31 13:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472130, 339524, 51538, '<td valign="top">Isolation.  Nice.  Better if the figures were more into the empty zone.</td>', 'Isolation.  Nice.  Better if the figures were more into the empty zone.', '2006-05-31 13:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472136, 338738, 51538, '<td valign="top">Orwellian (as in 1984 by George Orwell).</td>', 'Orwellian (as in 1984 by George Orwell).', '2006-05-31 13:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472142, 339753, 51538, '<td valign="top">Busy and interesting image.  It''s easy to flip past it - but once the eye is caught, there is plenty to entertain..</td>', 'Busy and interesting image.  It''s easy to flip past it - but once the eye is caught, there is plenty to entertain..', '2006-05-31 13:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472147, 339580, 51538, '<td valign="top">Great under bridge lighting.  If it was my image, I might well have cropped out the city (or desaturated it perhaps).  The city is a little distracting.</td>', 'Great under bridge lighting.  If it was my image, I might well have cropped out the city (or desaturated it perhaps).  The city is a little distracting.', '2006-05-31 13:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472251, 339875, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  The silver against the light blue really works well.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  The silver against the light blue really works well.', '2006-05-31 14:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472255, 338749, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good use of leading lines.</td>', 'Very good use of leading lines.', '2006-05-31 14:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472258, 339775, 35602, '<td valign="top">Classic.  A bit too dark, though.  Too bad there wasn''t more light shining on the foreground rocks and reflecting in the water.</td>', 'Classic.  A bit too dark, though.  Too bad there wasn''t more light shining on the foreground rocks and reflecting in the water.', '2006-05-31 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472263, 339620, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color against the black and white background.  Well composed and very focused on the light.  Love the play of light on the arch as well.  Very nice image.</td>', 'Nice use of color against the black and white background.  Well composed and very focused on the light.  Love the play of light on the arch as well.  Very nice image.', '2006-05-31 14:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472268, 338748, 35602, '<td valign="top">Exposure is a bit off.  The balance could have been adjusted in post processing by extracting the area that is  too dark and brightening it so more detail is visible.</td>', 'Exposure is a bit off.  The balance could have been adjusted in post processing by extracting the area that is  too dark and brightening it so more detail is visible.', '2006-05-31 14:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472272, 338978, 35602, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but it seems too low contrast.  Also subject is okay, but not overwhelming.</td>', 'Good composition, but it seems too low contrast.  Also subject is okay, but not overwhelming.', '2006-05-31 14:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472336, 339687, 208, '<td valign="top">I like how subtly the "HYATT" is blue to help it pop from the rest of the shot.</td>', 'I like how subtly the "HYATT" is blue to help it pop from the rest of the shot.', '2006-05-31 14:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472346, 339863, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool angle here. Great choice to put a person in this shot, especially with the red dress.</td>', 'Cool angle here. Great choice to put a person in this shot, especially with the red dress.', '2006-05-31 14:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472348, 339471, 208, '<td valign="top">Well seen, but the lighting is kind of dull, muting the colors.</td>', 'Well seen, but the lighting is kind of dull, muting the colors.', '2006-05-31 14:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472357, 339881, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice work suggesting the two spires with the two flowers sticking up higher. Beautiful colors, too.</td>', 'Nice work suggesting the two spires with the two flowers sticking up higher. Beautiful colors, too.', '2006-05-31 14:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472364, 339671, 208, '<td valign="top">It might be my monitor, but there seems to be weird banding in the sky. Otherwise, cool shot. Nice composition, great contrasts.</td>', 'It might be my monitor, but there seems to be weird banding in the sky. Otherwise, cool shot. Nice composition, great contrasts.', '2006-05-31 14:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472374, 338738, 208, '<td valign="top">Way overprocessed/saturated for my taste, bordering on digital art.</td>', 'Way overprocessed/saturated for my taste, bordering on digital art.', '2006-05-31 15:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472381, 339265, 208, '<td valign="top">seems like there''s a red tinge to this shot</td>', 'seems like there''s a red tinge to this shot', '2006-05-31 15:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472388, 339421, 208, '<td valign="top">All the curves go to the bluest part of the sky - nice.</td>', 'All the curves go to the bluest part of the sky - nice.', '2006-05-31 15:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472412, 339776, 208, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t really help flatter the building. It''s just a straight-on shot, but the symmetrical profile is lost in the trees. It looks flat because of the lighting, and the background is sort of boring and washed out. You have a line leading from top-left to middle-right, but there''s nothing to see there. Maybe try a different time of day or from another angle?</td>', 'This shot doesn''t really help flatter the building. It''s just a straight-on shot, but the symmetrical profile is lost in the trees. It looks flat because of the lighting, and the background is sort of boring and washed out. You have a line leading from top-left to middle-right, but there''s nothing to see there. Maybe try a different time of day or from another angle?', '2006-05-31 15:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472419, 339867, 208, '<td valign="top">Cute title. I like the stark white against the deep blue. Interesting lines. Could be a little sharper, but the overall effect is great.</td>', 'Cute title. I like the stark white against the deep blue. Interesting lines. Could be a little sharper, but the overall effect is great.', '2006-05-31 15:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472421, 339642, 208, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you blew it out on purpose, but I''d like some detail in the white, especially with so little in the sky.</td>', 'I''m guessing you blew it out on purpose, but I''d like some detail in the white, especially with so little in the sky.', '2006-05-31 15:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472484, 339891, 208, '<td valign="top">Way too much blue, Batman. Interesting idea to contrast the old red brick with the new blue glass, but all that blue reflected in the old buildings'' windows ruin the effect.</td>', 'Way too much blue, Batman. Interesting idea to contrast the old red brick with the new blue glass, but all that blue reflected in the old buildings'' windows ruin the effect.', '2006-05-31 15:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472489, 339847, 208, '<td valign="top">I wish the clock tower were brighter, but it still stands out from that sky pretty well.</td>', 'I wish the clock tower were brighter, but it still stands out from that sky pretty well.', '2006-05-31 15:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472492, 339701, 208, '<td valign="top">The person at the bottom is a nice touch - gives the viewer a much better grasp of the fountain''s scale.</td>', 'The person at the bottom is a nice touch - gives the viewer a much better grasp of the fountain''s scale.', '2006-05-31 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472522, 339118, 208, '<td valign="top">I kind of like how boring this is. You''ve perfectly captured typical hotel "design." Bland colors. Dirty carpet. Almost symmetrical. I''m waiting for little Danny Torrance to come around the corner riding his Big Wheel.</td>', 'I kind of like how boring this is. You''ve perfectly captured typical hotel "design." Bland colors. Dirty carpet. Almost symmetrical. I''m waiting for little Danny Torrance to come around the corner riding his Big Wheel.', '2006-05-31 15:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472605, 339322, 56849, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph a 10 in a different catagory, the best shot I have seen on this site!</td>', 'This is a great photograph a 10 in a different catagory, the best shot I have seen on this site!', '2006-05-31 16:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472628, 339840, 208, '<td valign="top">love the lines here. The muted sky is nice, too -- helps set off the black lines of the bridge cables and building silhouettes. I hate to say it, but the Chrysler Building sort of takes away from the overall effect by sticking out like that.</td>', 'love the lines here. The muted sky is nice, too -- helps set off the black lines of the bridge cables and building silhouettes. I hate to say it, but the Chrysler Building sort of takes away from the overall effect by sticking out like that.', '2006-05-31 16:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472651, 339211, 208, '<td valign="top">The detail is just amazing!</td>', 'The detail is just amazing!', '2006-05-31 16:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472667, 339557, 208, '<td valign="top">hey -- a shot of the Gold Dome that isn''t mine!</td>', 'hey -- a shot of the Gold Dome that isn''t mine!', '2006-05-31 16:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472868, 339656, 47205, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot</td>', 'Interesting shot', '2006-05-31 17:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473015, 339633, 46177, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, nice landscape. Bumping up on second look. 9</td>', 'Beautiful sky, nice landscape. Bumping up on second look. 9', '2006-05-31 17:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473236, 339739, 35044, '<td valign="top">Superb take.  Great colour palette.</td>', 'Superb take.  Great colour palette.', '2006-05-31 18:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473276, 339821, 49007, '<td valign="top">This is NOT high-key. This is high contrast. Open this in your editing software and you''ll see a U shaped histogram with spikes on the left and right edges. High-key and low-key are possible do to a lack of contrast.<br/> <br/>A high key image has most of it''s color dat in the right-most 20% of the graph. You can do this by Using the Hue/Saturation/Lightness dialog to Lighten or push to color data to the right.<br/> <br/>Nice image. Good contrast.</td>', 'This is NOT high-key. This is high contrast. Open this in your editing software and you''ll see a U shaped histogram with spikes on the left and right edges. High-key and low-key are possible do to a lack of contrast. A high key image has most of it''s color dat in the right-most 20% of the graph. You can do this by Using the Hue/Saturation/Lightness dialog to Lighten or push to color data to the right. Nice image. Good contrast.', '2006-05-31 19:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473401, 339701, 29293, '<td valign="top">i must give you a high score as i am an alumni bsme 1981</td>', 'i must give you a high score as i am an alumni bsme 1981', '2006-05-31 19:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473512, 339513, 24613, '<td valign="top">Covered bridges are so cool!  This is a really nice shot. :)</td>', 'Covered bridges are so cool!  This is a really nice shot. :)', '2006-05-31 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473519, 339882, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very clear!  Good work here! 9</td>', 'Very nice, very clear!  Good work here! 9', '2006-05-31 20:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473555, 339600, 58868, '<td valign="top">wow great shot,</td>', 'wow great shot,', '2006-05-31 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473557, 339678, 58868, '<td valign="top">Very well done, I love everything about it.</td>', 'Very well done, I love everything about it.', '2006-05-31 20:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473560, 338447, 58868, '<td valign="top">great angle, nice shot.</td>', 'great angle, nice shot.', '2006-05-31 20:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473582, 338528, 58868, '<td valign="top">wow, love the composition.....the mts are a great background.</td>', 'wow, love the composition.....the mts are a great background.', '2006-05-31 20:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473588, 339739, 58868, '<td valign="top">i really like tis shot...the angle is awesome, and tone, and colors give it a mysterious feel. 9</td>', 'i really like tis shot...the angle is awesome, and tone, and colors give it a mysterious feel. 9', '2006-05-31 20:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473667, 339557, 40718, '<td valign="top">Damn those trees!  They aren''t terrible, but they do limit the shot.  Nice exposure and this is one of my favorite shades of blue for sky.</td>', 'Damn those trees!  They aren''t terrible, but they do limit the shot.  Nice exposure and this is one of my favorite shades of blue for sky.', '2006-05-31 20:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473672, 338391, 40718, '<td valign="top">I have become the hugest fan of clouds.  Maybe that''s good since I live in the Pacific NW.  Great job on exposure.  I''m guessing double conversion in RAW because the dynamic range between the door and bright cloud is quite large. 8</td>', 'I have become the hugest fan of clouds.  Maybe that''s good since I live in the Pacific NW.  Great job on exposure.  I''m guessing double conversion in RAW because the dynamic range between the door and bright cloud is quite large. 8', '2006-05-31 20:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473678, 339568, 40718, '<td valign="top">Tough lighting and that blasted car limit the shot. 5</td>', 'Tough lighting and that blasted car limit the shot. 5', '2006-05-31 20:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473679, 339124, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing composition of engineering and architecture.  The colours are great.</td>', 'Very pleasing composition of engineering and architecture.  The colours are great.', '2006-05-31 20:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473682, 339633, 51538, '<td valign="top">If it''s not Iceland, I''ll eat my hat.</td>', 'If it''s not Iceland, I''ll eat my hat.', '2006-05-31 20:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473684, 339715, 40718, '<td valign="top">Great complimentary colors. I may have been tempted to clone out that blue smudge.  Has "wow" in a different way, but the average DPC voter may not see that. 7</td>', 'Great complimentary colors. I may have been tempted to clone out that blue smudge.  Has "wow" in a different way, but the average DPC voter may not see that. 7', '2006-05-31 20:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473693, 339432, 40718, '<td valign="top">Oversharp?  I wonder from the upper left roof.  Could be wrong about that.  The sky and trees unfortunately don''t add a lot.  Could have tried a double RAW conversion.  Cute title. 6</td>', 'Oversharp?  I wonder from the upper left roof.  Could be wrong about that.  The sky and trees unfortunately don''t add a lot.  Could have tried a double RAW conversion.  Cute title. 6', '2006-05-31 20:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473698, 339042, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  Sounds like Plath, but probably isn''t.  Paint texture is outstanding.  For photographic purposes, paint gets better with age and weather.  Nice that you submitted something out of the ordinary.</td>', 'Nice title.  Sounds like Plath, but probably isn''t.  Paint texture is outstanding.  For photographic purposes, paint gets better with age and weather.  Nice that you submitted something out of the ordinary.', '2006-05-31 20:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473703, 339265, 40718, '<td valign="top">The dark green grass dominates too much of the canvas.  The blown sky doesn''t help either.  Tough subject as it lacks "wow", but perhaps it''s all you had to shoot.</td>', 'The dark green grass dominates too much of the canvas.  The blown sky doesn''t help either.  Tough subject as it lacks "wow", but perhaps it''s all you had to shoot.', '2006-05-31 20:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473704, 339899, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so sharp and pretty!   Vibrant summer colors.   There''s something about it that really appeals to me.   I want to live there  :)   Great job.</td>', 'This is so sharp and pretty!   Vibrant summer colors.   There''s something about it that really appeals to me.   I want to live there  :)   Great job.', '2006-05-31 20:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473705, 339429, 51538, '<td valign="top">Not a bad title with several possible meanings.  Modern architecture is very often sterilized and somewhat dead, IMO.  This is a clever photo.</td>', 'Not a bad title with several possible meanings.  Modern architecture is very often sterilized and somewhat dead, IMO.  This is a clever photo.', '2006-05-31 20:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473706, 339211, 51538, '<td valign="top">Attractive presentation.</td>', 'Attractive presentation.', '2006-05-31 20:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473711, 339583, 40718, '<td valign="top">I just gotta get me IR.  Never seen it with the yellow tint though.  Neat though.  I can''t decide if the boats help or hinder.  Too much of an apparent anachronism I think. 7</td>', 'I just gotta get me IR.  Never seen it with the yellow tint though.  Neat though.  I can''t decide if the boats help or hinder.  Too much of an apparent anachronism I think. 7', '2006-05-31 20:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473717, 339158, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty place.  I imagine it is a place of myriad moods in light and weather.</td>', 'Pretty place.  I imagine it is a place of myriad moods in light and weather.', '2006-05-31 20:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473720, 339369, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice tower.  The image is a bit flat, but that is probably limited by the clouds which you had to keep from blowing out.  Perhaps a boost to yellows to bring the lawn out more and make it seem more alive. 6</td>', 'Nice tower.  The image is a bit flat, but that is probably limited by the clouds which you had to keep from blowing out.  Perhaps a boost to yellows to bring the lawn out more and make it seem more alive. 6', '2006-05-31 20:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473725, 339873, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely point of view and interpretation.  The human and architecture, which not too many of the entries to this challenge juxtapose.  Nice work!</td>', 'Lovely point of view and interpretation.  The human and architecture, which not too many of the entries to this challenge juxtapose.  Nice work!', '2006-05-31 20:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473726, 338689, 40718, '<td valign="top">Clone the gal out!  I hate people in my architecture shots. ;)  She does give scale though.  Wasn''t this the place where they shot a pic with the 4 Gigapixel camera?</td>', 'Clone the gal out!  I hate people in my architecture shots. ;)  She does give scale though.  Wasn''t this the place where they shot a pic with the 4 Gigapixel camera?', '2006-05-31 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
