(2473776, 339580, 38032, '<td valign="top">WOW! .... THis is such an amazing use of a wide lens.  Great POV . Beautiful all over.  rare 10 from me and fave</td>', 'WOW! .... THis is such an amazing use of a wide lens.  Great POV . Beautiful all over.  rare 10 from me and fave', '2006-05-31 20:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473779, 339656, 40718, '<td valign="top">Creative.  Likely getting pounded!  Wear it as a badge of honor.  I have certainly heard of computer architecture.  Beyond that, I think there are a few technical issues.  I don''t like the circuit in shadow look on the right.  The circuits look either oversharpened or just lost in detail (can''t decide which).  I''m stumped on how to vote images like this.  i''ll give it a neutral 6 which I''m 99% sure is raising your score.</td>', 'Creative.  Likely getting pounded!  Wear it as a badge of honor.  I have certainly heard of computer architecture.  Beyond that, I think there are a few technical issues.  I don''t like the circuit in shadow look on the right.  The circuits look either oversharpened or just lost in detail (can''t decide which).  I''m stumped on how to vote images like this.  i''ll give it a neutral 6 which I''m 99% sure is raising your score.', '2006-05-31 20:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473791, 338297, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Did you use NI?  The dreamy quality is sorta neat.  7</td>', 'I like it.  Did you use NI?  The dreamy quality is sorta neat.  7', '2006-05-31 21:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473796, 339608, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love some of the stuff we have in our areas. WTF?  Nice POV and technicals. 8</td>', 'I love some of the stuff we have in our areas. WTF?  Nice POV and technicals. 8', '2006-05-31 21:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473799, 338411, 40718, '<td valign="top">Funny, I almost entered a shot of a sign that said "Portland".  Love the color of the sky.  Has some artifacting around the borders of the building.  The double exposure of the words is unfortunate. 6</td>', 'Funny, I almost entered a shot of a sign that said "Portland".  Love the color of the sky.  Has some artifacting around the borders of the building.  The double exposure of the words is unfortunate. 6', '2006-05-31 21:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473802, 338439, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  The harshness adds a good feel with the sky.  I may have cropped a bit off the right. 7</td>', 'Nice lighting.  The harshness adds a good feel with the sky.  I may have cropped a bit off the right. 7', '2006-05-31 21:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473807, 339025, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Nice sky.  Maybe could have boosted the brick colors a bit.  They are washed out compared to the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Nice sky.  Maybe could have boosted the brick colors a bit.  They are washed out compared to the rest of the shot.', '2006-05-31 21:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473810, 339825, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ho, brave.  A negative image outside the negative image challenge.  Scandal!   Unfortunately it''s a bit boring in composition and the negative aspect doesn''t add a ton (well, I guess the black background is better than white). 5</td>', 'Ho, brave.  A negative image outside the negative image challenge.  Scandal!   Unfortunately it''s a bit boring in composition and the negative aspect doesn''t add a ton (well, I guess the black background is better than white). 5', '2006-05-31 21:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473815, 338738, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  Love the moodiness.  Maybe it was burned just a tad too much.  Nice composition and colors. 7</td>', 'Nice sky.  Love the moodiness.  Maybe it was burned just a tad too much.  Nice composition and colors. 7', '2006-05-31 21:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2473820, 339145, 40718, '<td valign="top">Could you have cut the tree down? Ha.  Well, I wish it wasn''t there anyway.  Neat POV.  Neat sky.  A bit of PP artifact I think around the tree on the left.</td>', 'Could you have cut the tree down? Ha.  Well, I wish it wasn''t there anyway.  Neat POV.  Neat sky.  A bit of PP artifact I think around the tree on the left.', '2006-05-31 21:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
