(2475312, 339698, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the way the doors are all together.  It seems to have too much in the image, though, but I can''t figure out what would be the best part to focus on.  My eye is drawn mostly to the door with the stairs showing, or the tower in the background.  Anyway, it is a complicated image that has great potential to draw out many aspects of it in several crops, without losing interest.  I have been looking at this image for about 2 minutes, and the longer I look, the better I like what you did here.  I hope others do the same, otherwise it will be underrated.</td>', 'I like the way the doors are all together.  It seems to have too much in the image, though, but I can''t figure out what would be the best part to focus on.  My eye is drawn mostly to the door with the stairs showing, or the tower in the background.  Anyway, it is a complicated image that has great potential to draw out many aspects of it in several crops, without losing interest.  I have been looking at this image for about 2 minutes, and the longer I look, the better I like what you did here.  I hope others do the same, otherwise it will be underrated.', '2006-06-01 07:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
