(2476636, 339617, 37707, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.... Black and white is probably not a very good idea and the lighting is a bit too harsh.</td>', 'Nice idea.... Black and white is probably not a very good idea and the lighting is a bit too harsh.', '2006-06-01 18:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
