(2476676, 339878, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hello Robert. The Kimmel Center by famed architect Rafael Vinoly ;) This image truly creates dynamic characteristics due to the curves against the horizontals within the space ;) I think the sky color could have been saturated slightly so as not to appear too gray. Great colors and a wonderful abstract to add to your images ;) Good luck!</td>', 'Hello Robert. The Kimmel Center by famed architect Rafael Vinoly ;) This image truly creates dynamic characteristics due to the curves against the horizontals within the space ;) I think the sky color could have been saturated slightly so as not to appear too gray. Great colors and a wonderful abstract to add to your images ;) Good luck!', '2006-06-01 18:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476679, 338854, 37502, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and placement of old and new. I don''t care for the selective desat but I think it may look better as black/white.</td>', 'I love the composition and placement of old and new. I don''t care for the selective desat but I think it may look better as black/white.', '2006-06-01 18:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476693, 339881, 37502, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, I''d like it more if the center of the bldg was centered in the photo</td>', 'Interesting angle, I''d like it more if the center of the bldg was centered in the photo', '2006-06-01 18:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476696, 339848, 37502, '<td valign="top">Nice composition...it seems somewhat abstract but you can still identify the building.</td>', 'Nice composition...it seems somewhat abstract but you can still identify the building.', '2006-06-01 18:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476699, 338990, 59910, '<td valign="top">nice view</td>', 'nice view', '2006-06-01 18:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476700, 338984, 37502, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures and contrast</td>', 'Beautiful textures and contrast', '2006-06-01 18:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476706, 339513, 37502, '<td valign="top">The light at the top of the photo is very distracting...not enough texture. I''m guessing you were shooting into the sun, if you had the sun on the long side you''d get more texture.</td>', 'The light at the top of the photo is very distracting...not enough texture. I''m guessing you were shooting into the sun, if you had the sun on the long side you''d get more texture.', '2006-06-01 18:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476721, 339471, 37502, '<td valign="top">looks a little blurry</td>', 'looks a little blurry', '2006-06-01 18:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476728, 339386, 37502, '<td valign="top">Great interior, I could definitely see this in a magazine or advertisement</td>', 'Great interior, I could definitely see this in a magazine or advertisement', '2006-06-01 18:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476859, 338628, 49326, '<td valign="top">Amazing light. I love it!</td>', 'Amazing light. I love it!', '2006-06-01 19:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476861, 339851, 49326, '<td valign="top">I would like to se more of the building.</td>', 'I would like to se more of the building.', '2006-06-01 19:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476867, 339401, 49326, '<td valign="top">I see it is supposed to be dark I think it''s a little too dark. You could have lighten it up or dodged or something.</td>', 'I see it is supposed to be dark I think it''s a little too dark. You could have lighten it up or dodged or something.', '2006-06-01 19:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476889, 339091, 49326, '<td valign="top">It looks like a natural frame. I like it.</td>', 'It looks like a natural frame. I like it.', '2006-06-01 19:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2476893, 339889, 40370, '<td valign="top">I know everybody always talks about the rule of 1/3''s but in this image I can''t help but want to see more building, not sure if you even had the option.</td>', 'I know everybody always talks about the rule of 1/3''s but in this image I can''t help but want to see more building, not sure if you even had the option.', '2006-06-01 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477054, 339211, 35602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I especially like the v formed at the bottom of the pic.  Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I especially like the v formed at the bottom of the pic.  Great job.', '2006-06-01 21:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477058, 339852, 8759, '<td valign="top">A good picture of a very interesting subject. The square crop works excelent.</td>', 'A good picture of a very interesting subject. The square crop works excelent.', '2006-06-01 21:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477063, 338984, 35602, '<td valign="top">I love the muted colors on thi sone.  That green door really gives this shot that something extra.</td>', 'I love the muted colors on thi sone.  That green door really gives this shot that something extra.', '2006-06-01 21:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477072, 339827, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very geometric, which is nice compositionally.  Shot is definitely a good angle and lighting, but it doesn''t ride to the top unfortunately.</td>', 'Very geometric, which is nice compositionally.  Shot is definitely a good angle and lighting, but it doesn''t ride to the top unfortunately.', '2006-06-01 21:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477078, 339376, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems overprocessed.  I know it was to try to get better details, but the contrast and sharpness seems to have given the lines a broken look.</td>', 'Seems overprocessed.  I know it was to try to get better details, but the contrast and sharpness seems to have given the lines a broken look.', '2006-06-01 21:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477082, 339362, 35602, '<td valign="top">Needs more.  Details of building are really lost in the compensation to get the sky well exposed.  The sky is wonderful, but the building is very dark.</td>', 'Needs more.  Details of building are really lost in the compensation to get the sky well exposed.  The sky is wonderful, but the building is very dark.', '2006-06-01 21:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477087, 339646, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines.  I like your title, too.</td>', 'Very nice lines.  I like your title, too.', '2006-06-01 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477090, 338621, 35602, '<td valign="top">Well it wouldn''t be an architecture challenge without the most famous piece of architecture in the world.  Very nice.</td>', 'Well it wouldn''t be an architecture challenge without the most famous piece of architecture in the world.  Very nice.', '2006-06-01 21:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477129, 339124, 54182, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, Love the reflections, Love this picture. Great work. I know this will do well.</td>', 'Love the colors, Love the reflections, Love this picture. Great work. I know this will do well.', '2006-06-01 21:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477134, 339672, 54182, '<td valign="top">The sepia does this picture well. I like how it makes the sky look dark and foreboding.</td>', 'The sepia does this picture well. I like how it makes the sky look dark and foreboding.', '2006-06-01 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477138, 339255, 54182, '<td valign="top">This is what I think a well executed Architecture shot should be.</td>', 'This is what I think a well executed Architecture shot should be.', '2006-06-01 21:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477139, 339737, 54182, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of Old vs. New here.</td>', 'I like the contrast of Old vs. New here.', '2006-06-01 21:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477140, 339621, 54182, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I like the reflection. Looks like a Motivational poster.</td>', 'Very nice picture. I like the reflection. Looks like a Motivational poster.', '2006-06-01 21:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477142, 339113, 54182, '<td valign="top">Good example of what I would expect from an Architecture picture. Nice shot. Kind of looks like a rolar coaster track.</td>', 'Good example of what I would expect from an Architecture picture. Nice shot. Kind of looks like a rolar coaster track.', '2006-06-01 21:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477143, 338478, 54182, '<td valign="top">Great Colors, I like how the pattern is on the floor too.</td>', 'Great Colors, I like how the pattern is on the floor too.', '2006-06-01 21:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477150, 338689, 54182, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection in this one.</td>', 'I like the reflection in this one.', '2006-06-01 21:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477152, 338729, 54182, '<td valign="top">I like the block pattern.</td>', 'I like the block pattern.', '2006-06-01 21:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477158, 339711, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very simple and a natural duotone.  The blue and orange are very complementary.  Like the sweep of the image.  Leads the eye to the other side, and makes you wonder if the hall ends, or what the view is like, etc.</td>', 'Very simple and a natural duotone.  The blue and orange are very complementary.  Like the sweep of the image.  Leads the eye to the other side, and makes you wonder if the hall ends, or what the view is like, etc.', '2006-06-01 21:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477187, 339682, 35602, '<td valign="top">Hmm, is the tilt a political comment on the orthodox church?  Well, that is the way I will see it.  Nice detail on the image.</td>', 'Hmm, is the tilt a political comment on the orthodox church?  Well, that is the way I will see it.  Nice detail on the image.', '2006-06-01 21:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477194, 339513, 35602, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t have taken out the signs on the front.  Anyway, compostion and angle seem all right.  Image is very soft, though.  Would have liked to see really sharp detail on the wood of the bridge.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t have taken out the signs on the front.  Anyway, compostion and angle seem all right.  Image is very soft, though.  Would have liked to see really sharp detail on the wood of the bridge.', '2006-06-01 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477196, 338956, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very well composed.  Sky is very nice too.</td>', 'Very well composed.  Sky is very nice too.', '2006-06-01 22:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477201, 339642, 35602, '<td valign="top">As a contemporary style, this is great.  The simple white and blue, with very little detail works well for the cosmopolitan lifestyle.  I like the fact that the windows show some detail.  Makes you wonder what is inside.</td>', 'As a contemporary style, this is great.  The simple white and blue, with very little detail works well for the cosmopolitan lifestyle.  I like the fact that the windows show some detail.  Makes you wonder what is inside.', '2006-06-01 22:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477205, 339432, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  This one cracked me up.  Says something about the humor of the person who either lives here or uses it as a hideaway.</td>', 'Very cute.  This one cracked me up.  Says something about the humor of the person who either lives here or uses it as a hideaway.', '2006-06-01 22:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477221, 339867, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well-composed and quite striking.</td>', 'Well-composed and quite striking.', '2006-06-01 22:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477224, 339726, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and very nice lighting chosen for the time of this picture.</td>', 'Interesting angle and very nice lighting chosen for the time of this picture.', '2006-06-01 22:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477228, 339843, 30982, '<td valign="top">The patterns very much appeal to me in this shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'The patterns very much appeal to me in this shot.  Nicely done.', '2006-06-01 22:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477237, 339824, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice light chosen for this exposure.  Colors and shapes work well.</td>', 'Nice light chosen for this exposure.  Colors and shapes work well.', '2006-06-01 22:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477248, 339827, 30982, '<td valign="top">Graphically striking - well seen and composed.</td>', 'Graphically striking - well seen and composed.', '2006-06-01 22:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477258, 338628, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors!  If you get a chance to shoot this again, try it such that you don''t get the fountain.</td>', 'Very nice colors!  If you get a chance to shoot this again, try it such that you don''t get the fountain.', '2006-06-01 22:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477292, 339168, 30982, '<td valign="top">The building is a bit underexposed - they eye is drawn toward the sky (which is lovely) then lettering on the boat.</td>', 'The building is a bit underexposed - they eye is drawn toward the sky (which is lovely) then lettering on the boat.', '2006-06-01 22:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477293, 339825, 30982, '<td valign="top">Use of the negative image is interesting here - definitely highlights the shapes.</td>', 'Use of the negative image is interesting here - definitely highlights the shapes.', '2006-06-01 22:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477298, 339269, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and shapes and different materials shown.  This is one case where the perspective may have hurt the picture a bit with the right side leaning a bit too much.</td>', 'I like the colors and shapes and different materials shown.  This is one case where the perspective may have hurt the picture a bit with the right side leaning a bit too much.', '2006-06-01 22:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477327, 339257, 28471, '<td valign="top">Even though your buildings have converging lines this photo is still well composed... surprising - the Sign helps provide a good POI and draw attention from the buildings.  Good job. (7)</td>', 'Even though your buildings have converging lines this photo is still well composed... surprising - the Sign helps provide a good POI and draw attention from the buildings.  Good job. (7)', '2006-06-01 22:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477335, 339322, 28471, '<td valign="top">Fisheye wide open?  Quite a bit of distortion in this photo.  Lens correction filter in PS may have helped.</td>', 'Fisheye wide open?  Quite a bit of distortion in this photo.  Lens correction filter in PS may have helped.', '2006-06-01 22:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477347, 339211, 26464, '<td valign="top">i like how close you got me with this</td>', 'i like how close you got me with this', '2006-06-01 22:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477348, 339580, 26464, '<td valign="top">very cool view</td>', 'very cool view', '2006-06-01 22:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477356, 339370, 15407, '<td valign="top">Your attention to detail produced an excellent composure</td>', 'Your attention to detail produced an excellent composure', '2006-06-01 22:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477365, 339624, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice minitiare</td>', 'nice minitiare', '2006-06-01 22:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477369, 339499, 26464, '<td valign="top">great colour</td>', 'great colour', '2006-06-01 22:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477372, 339539, 26464, '<td valign="top">love to be there</td>', 'love to be there', '2006-06-01 22:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477387, 338393, 58683, '<td valign="top">I like the look of the building, but I think the flat colours and the overcast sky let this shot down. I wonder whether it would be possible to capture a sunset or sunrise reflection on the glass, which might have made things a bit more dramatic or interesting.</td>', 'I like the look of the building, but I think the flat colours and the overcast sky let this shot down. I wonder whether it would be possible to capture a sunset or sunrise reflection on the glass, which might have made things a bit more dramatic or interesting.', '2006-06-01 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477400, 339851, 37444, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I''d prefer a bit above the main flagpole - looks cut off.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I''d prefer a bit above the main flagpole - looks cut off.', '2006-06-01 23:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477402, 339676, 37444, '<td valign="top">Nice image other than the blown out sky portions.</td>', 'Nice image other than the blown out sky portions.', '2006-06-01 23:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
