(2477593, 339432, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hehehehee. Nice title and I love the juxstaposition of the shack and Buckingham Palace. The Queen is probably going through rough times huh?<br/> <br/>The building in itself is simple. The textures lend to an old feel of a time long lost. The setting is appropriate for this image so a sense of place is established. Except for that huge branch on the upper left corner serving as a slight distraction, I have to admit that this is great in its own right.</td>', 'Hehehehee. Nice title and I love the juxstaposition of the shack and Buckingham Palace. The Queen is probably going through rough times huh? The building in itself is simple. The textures lend to an old feel of a time long lost. The setting is appropriate for this image so a sense of place is established. Except for that huge branch on the upper left corner serving as a slight distraction, I have to admit that this is great in its own right.', '2006-06-01 23:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
