(2477603, 339863, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is a nice simple image that lends to be more of an advertisement than a strong architectural photograph. The leading lines work well and the model becomes the main subject of your composition and the architecture serves as a backdrop. metal panels of Gehry''s Disney Hall is hard to photograph as seen from the blown highlights in this image. (7)</td>', 'This is a nice simple image that lends to be more of an advertisement than a strong architectural photograph. The leading lines work well and the model becomes the main subject of your composition and the architecture serves as a backdrop. metal panels of Gehry''s Disney Hall is hard to photograph as seen from the blown highlights in this image. (7)', '2006-06-01 23:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477605, 339124, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  The colors and reflections are really cool - really gives a different sheen to all the metal.  Great find and nice composition! I suspect this will do pretty well.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a great shot!  The colors and reflections are really cool - really gives a different sheen to all the metal.  Great find and nice composition! I suspect this will do pretty well.  Good luck!', '2006-06-01 23:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
