(2477627, 339616, 37893, '<td valign="top">Ahhh... made famous by architect Andrea Palladio and seen here by the use of the Palladian arches. I''m not sure how to react to this image. On one hand, it''s a great piece of architecture but on the other, it''s more of a landscape than anything else. The architecture seems secondary except for the placement of the the bridge in the composition. I would have probably preferred a closer shot that shows the true beauty and grandeur of these arches ;)</td>', 'Ahhh... made famous by architect Andrea Palladio and seen here by the use of the Palladian arches. I''m not sure how to react to this image. On one hand, it''s a great piece of architecture but on the other, it''s more of a landscape than anything else. The architecture seems secondary except for the placement of the the bridge in the composition. I would have probably preferred a closer shot that shows the true beauty and grandeur of these arches ;)', '2006-06-01 23:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
