(2477771, 339042, 15407, '<td valign="top">Mirrors in the penitentiary?</td>', 'Mirrors in the penitentiary?', '2006-06-02 00:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477773, 339863, 8759, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the title. Is more like new world, way to dreams...Oh Escape from reality. Works well for me anyway, the contrast of red and blue, the sinous shapes. 9</td>', 'I don''t really get the title. Is more like new world, way to dreams...Oh Escape from reality. Works well for me anyway, the contrast of red and blue, the sinous shapes. 9', '2006-06-02 00:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477779, 339478, 8759, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you made it but it looks nice. Drops a little sharper then the water tower. Nice!</td>', 'Don''t know how you made it but it looks nice. Drops a little sharper then the water tower. Nice!', '2006-06-02 00:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477803, 339856, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful church, great night shot.</td>', 'What a beautiful church, great night shot.', '2006-06-02 00:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477809, 339545, 59932, '<td valign="top">Great minimalist approach!  The cropping really accenuates the architectural details.  I love the shadows cast by the designs on the righthand side.  The exposure looks good.  My only advice is that the colors seem to have an overall warm cast - perhaps it could be cooled down.</td>', 'Great minimalist approach!  The cropping really accenuates the architectural details.  I love the shadows cast by the designs on the righthand side.  The exposure looks good.  My only advice is that the colors seem to have an overall warm cast - perhaps it could be cooled down.', '2006-06-02 00:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477821, 339633, 10818, '<td valign="top">Looks like it will fit a cooler of beer, a laptop and my camera.  Thats enough for me.  What a great bunk house, or whatever it may be.<br/> <br/>Awesome shot !</td>', 'Looks like it will fit a cooler of beer, a laptop and my camera.  Thats enough for me.  What a great bunk house, or whatever it may be. Awesome shot !', '2006-06-02 00:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
