(2478694, 339257, 12733, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the sign and the interesting building across the street would have made this a great photo. The side street pulls the viewer''s eye away from the main subject and makes the picture seem busy.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the sign and the interesting building across the street would have made this a great photo. The side street pulls the viewer''s eye away from the main subject and makes the picture seem busy.', '2006-06-02 10:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478697, 339866, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting looking building, but too much of it is too black. The tilt seems gimmicky and doesn''t add anything to the picture.</td>', 'This is an interesting looking building, but too much of it is too black. The tilt seems gimmicky and doesn''t add anything to the picture.', '2006-06-02 10:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478699, 339470, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice leaf, but the architecture is too subtle for my taste.</td>', 'Nice leaf, but the architecture is too subtle for my taste.', '2006-06-02 10:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478701, 339864, 12733, '<td valign="top">There are some (very few) architectural subjects that gain from being shot on an angle. This isn''t one of them.</td>', 'There are some (very few) architectural subjects that gain from being shot on an angle. This isn''t one of them.', '2006-06-02 10:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478702, 339568, 12733, '<td valign="top">The contrast from top to bottom takes a lot away from this photo. Perhaps cropping to about the roof line of the background building and reducing the contrast would improve it.</td>', 'The contrast from top to bottom takes a lot away from this photo. Perhaps cropping to about the roof line of the background building and reducing the contrast would improve it.', '2006-06-02 10:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478704, 339282, 12733, '<td valign="top">Kind of a ho-hum example of architecture and an unimaginitive way of shooting it.</td>', 'Kind of a ho-hum example of architecture and an unimaginitive way of shooting it.', '2006-06-02 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478710, 339428, 12733, '<td valign="top">The foreground is a dark, brooding image; the background is light and nicely colored - the overall efect is confusing.</td>', 'The foreground is a dark, brooding image; the background is light and nicely colored - the overall efect is confusing.', '2006-06-02 10:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478712, 339645, 12733, '<td valign="top">Bus stop as architecture? Maybe, but there must be a more interesting way of presenting it. And why so small?</td>', 'Bus stop as architecture? Maybe, but there must be a more interesting way of presenting it. And why so small?', '2006-06-02 10:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478714, 339682, 12733, '<td valign="top">I hope someone braces this building before it falls over completely.</td>', 'I hope someone braces this building before it falls over completely.', '2006-06-02 10:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478715, 338986, 12733, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at this picture wondering what it is. It''s too real for an abstract, and too abstract for a photo of a building.</td>', 'I keep looking at this picture wondering what it is. It''s too real for an abstract, and too abstract for a photo of a building.', '2006-06-02 10:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
