(2479854, 339837, 40370, '<td valign="top">What caused the bright portions, the left side looks more like a low light (evening) but the blow-out disrupts the flow. Cool choice of location though.</td>', 'What caused the bright portions, the left side looks more like a low light (evening) but the blow-out disrupts the flow. Cool choice of location though.', '2006-06-02 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
