(2479873, 339787, 40370, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous looking architecture but wish you were closer, the lines of the railing are nice but this challenge calls for the building to be the main focal point. 6</td>', 'Gorgeous looking architecture but wish you were closer, the lines of the railing are nice but this challenge calls for the building to be the main focal point. 6', '2006-06-02 18:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479878, 339713, 40370, '<td valign="top">I do see the fun slant but the sidewalk line fights for my attention thus lessening the impact of the amazing architecture. I''d love to see this without the cement. 6</td>', 'I do see the fun slant but the sidewalk line fights for my attention thus lessening the impact of the amazing architecture. I''d love to see this without the cement. 6', '2006-06-02 18:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
