(2482329, 338772, 50126, '<td valign="top">It needs a bit more contrast, you''ve got some keystoning going on so I would have either straightened it out using perspective crop or else removed the left bit of the image which makes it so obvious. It also looks a tad soft but that might be the image reduction.</td>', 'It needs a bit more contrast, you''ve got some keystoning going on so I would have either straightened it out using perspective crop or else removed the left bit of the image which makes it so obvious. It also looks a tad soft but that might be the image reduction.', '2006-06-03 22:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482330, 339006, 50126, '<td valign="top">the casual dress of the woman is in total contrast with elegance of the interior of the church, and in this case, serves only as a distraction rather than enhancing the image. Had she been dressed in something more elegant and appropriate to the surroundings, it might have worked better.</td>', 'the casual dress of the woman is in total contrast with elegance of the interior of the church, and in this case, serves only as a distraction rather than enhancing the image. Had she been dressed in something more elegant and appropriate to the surroundings, it might have worked better.', '2006-06-03 22:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
