(2482373, 339852, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wacky, one of the better shots of metal architecture, other images in this challenge are too blown out in the sunlight, but this is on the dark side and makes the detail stand out better.</td>', 'Wacky, one of the better shots of metal architecture, other images in this challenge are too blown out in the sunlight, but this is on the dark side and makes the detail stand out better.', '2006-06-03 22:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
