(2482909, 339670, 56752, '<td valign="top">I feel this is too tightly cropped to really show off the architecture of the building</td>', 'I feel this is too tightly cropped to really show off the architecture of the building', '2006-06-04 04:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482910, 339837, 56752, '<td valign="top">A very cool building, but I think this shot is thrown off by the exposure; the overexposed bottom right part is too distracting to notice the lines of the building, and the underexposed parts fail to show the detail of the building, which I think would be a good thing to have here.</td>', 'A very cool building, but I think this shot is thrown off by the exposure; the overexposed bottom right part is too distracting to notice the lines of the building, and the underexposed parts fail to show the detail of the building, which I think would be a good thing to have here.', '2006-06-04 04:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482918, 339743, 56752, '<td valign="top">The problems I have with this image are the ''smudged'' look to it and the rather blatant halos around the building (especially on the left). I know DPC usually requires images which have a lot of punch, but I think this particular picture would be better off toning some of the adjustments down to preserve the integrity of the image.</td>', 'The problems I have with this image are the ''smudged'' look to it and the rather blatant halos around the building (especially on the left). I know DPC usually requires images which have a lot of punch, but I think this particular picture would be better off toning some of the adjustments down to preserve the integrity of the image.', '2006-06-04 04:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482924, 339513, 56752, '<td valign="top">Overexposure is plentiful in this picture; you might want to try dialing down the exposure compensation a few notches (or meter for the sky)</td>', 'Overexposure is plentiful in this picture; you might want to try dialing down the exposure compensation a few notches (or meter for the sky)', '2006-06-04 04:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482925, 338283, 56752, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool building and picture, but it''s a little too ''hazy'' on the right side, and with the dark tones of the building I would have tried to make the sky a little more prevalent. Minor quibbles aside, I like it.</td>', 'This is a really cool building and picture, but it''s a little too ''hazy'' on the right side, and with the dark tones of the building I would have tried to make the sky a little more prevalent. Minor quibbles aside, I like it.', '2006-06-04 04:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482961, 339863, 57322, '<td valign="top">excellent angle. perfect exposure, love it<br/>hope you win</td>', 'excellent angle. perfect exposure, love ithope you win', '2006-06-04 05:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483007, 339524, 30490, '<td valign="top">This looks over exposed to me</td>', 'This looks over exposed to me', '2006-06-04 06:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483010, 339837, 30490, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this image, the colors of the sky and the light on the steel, except the blown out center portion.  I don''t know if there was a way to capture this image without the high highlights, but unfortunately it lowered the score on the image. 5</td>', 'I like everything about this image, the colors of the sky and the light on the steel, except the blown out center portion.  I don''t know if there was a way to capture this image without the high highlights, but unfortunately it lowered the score on the image. 5', '2006-06-04 06:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483012, 339279, 30490, '<td valign="top">This image while creative just didn''t capture the architecture of the arches and the hole in the roof for me...</td>', 'This image while creative just didn''t capture the architecture of the arches and the hole in the roof for me...', '2006-06-04 06:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483014, 339257, 30490, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this image more with a tighter crop losing the cars and the trash bins from the bottom of the image.</td>', 'I would have liked this image more with a tighter crop losing the cars and the trash bins from the bottom of the image.', '2006-06-04 06:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483015, 338862, 30490, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fair amount of noise in this image...</td>', 'Looks like a fair amount of noise in this image...', '2006-06-04 06:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483016, 339729, 30490, '<td valign="top">Very different, but it just isn''t working for me.  The positive and negative aspects of the image are too distracting from the subject which is supposed to be architecture.</td>', 'Very different, but it just isn''t working for me.  The positive and negative aspects of the image are too distracting from the subject which is supposed to be architecture.', '2006-06-04 06:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483017, 339875, 30490, '<td valign="top">This perspective on the St. Louis arch just isn''t working for me.  You get a 5 for thinking outside the box though!</td>', 'This perspective on the St. Louis arch just isn''t working for me.  You get a 5 for thinking outside the box though!', '2006-06-04 06:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483019, 339237, 30490, '<td valign="top">This image is just too dark, and some fo the wonderful detail is lost.</td>', 'This image is just too dark, and some fo the wonderful detail is lost.', '2006-06-04 06:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483021, 339851, 30490, '<td valign="top">This is cropped too tightly for my taste, but it is still a great image 6</td>', 'This is cropped too tightly for my taste, but it is still a great image 6', '2006-06-04 06:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483040, 339421, 30364, '<td valign="top">Unlike many Frank Gehry designs, this one doesn''t look like it''s caught in the act of falling down.  This photograph is a very fine tribute because I imagine it depicts exactly what M. Gehry had in mind when he designed the building; soaring, concentrated, and just a little bit organic.  And a celebration of form over function, of course.  7.</td>', 'Unlike many Frank Gehry designs, this one doesn''t look like it''s caught in the act of falling down.  This photograph is a very fine tribute because I imagine it depicts exactly what M. Gehry had in mind when he designed the building; soaring, concentrated, and just a little bit organic.  And a celebration of form over function, of course.  7.', '2006-06-04 07:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483041, 338461, 30364, '<td valign="top">One of the few occasions when this nouveau-gothic post processing treatment is justified.  I think the architect would approve of what you''ve done.  7.</td>', 'One of the few occasions when this nouveau-gothic post processing treatment is justified.  I think the architect would approve of what you''ve done.  7.', '2006-06-04 07:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483048, 339201, 30364, '<td valign="top">It looks like the kind of photograph that the architect and his client would both happily pay you to take; very professional.  7.</td>', 'It looks like the kind of photograph that the architect and his client would both happily pay you to take; very professional.  7.', '2006-06-04 07:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483053, 339493, 32885, '<td valign="top">The building seems to be falling backwards.</td>', 'The building seems to be falling backwards.', '2006-06-04 07:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483054, 339852, 32885, '<td valign="top">This is just an awesome building. I like the image too.</td>', 'This is just an awesome building. I like the image too.', '2006-06-04 07:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483055, 339672, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice image. IMHO I am not a fan of sepia. It dulls the senses in this case.</td>', 'Nice image. IMHO I am not a fan of sepia. It dulls the senses in this case.', '2006-06-04 07:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483058, 338339, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice one. The perspective in this image is fascinating.</td>', 'Nice one. The perspective in this image is fascinating.', '2006-06-04 08:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483059, 339847, 32885, '<td valign="top">I love this image. It really stands out against a stormy sky. I hope it does well.</td>', 'I love this image. It really stands out against a stormy sky. I hope it does well.', '2006-06-04 08:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483062, 339740, 32885, '<td valign="top">Ah Venice, I remember it well!</td>', 'Ah Venice, I remember it well!', '2006-06-04 08:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483064, 338738, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is in Lansing, I think?  The almost cartoon-like level of colour saturation is effective here; it gives the building an energetic character and presence entirely consistent with its function.  The chosen exposure has also transformed the water into a surreal baseboard for this lovely (art deco?) industrial building ... makes it look a bit like a model rather than the real structure.  Clever &amp; thoughtful work.  8.</td>', 'This is in Lansing, I think?  The almost cartoon-like level of colour saturation is effective here; it gives the building an energetic character and presence entirely consistent with its function.  The chosen exposure has also transformed the water into a surreal baseboard for this lovely (art deco?) industrial building ... makes it look a bit like a model rather than the real structure.  Clever & thoughtful work.  8.', '2006-06-04 08:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483065, 339856, 32885, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a building. A great image. Well done.</td>', 'Wow, what a building. A great image. Well done.', '2006-06-04 08:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483068, 339428, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh, yes.  It''s everything <i>except</i> welcoming, isn''t it?  I deeply admire this sort of photograph; it''s so much harder to find, capture and process than it looks.  Architecture for masochists, maybe?  Bravo.  9.</td>', 'Oh, yes.  It''s everything except welcoming, isn''t it?  I deeply admire this sort of photograph; it''s so much harder to find, capture and process than it looks.  Architecture for masochists, maybe?  Bravo.  9.', '2006-06-04 08:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483072, 338447, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice image...it is one of the few that actually meets the challenge IMO.</td>', 'Nice image...it is one of the few that actually meets the challenge IMO.', '2006-06-04 08:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483073, 339042, 32885, '<td valign="top">This image meets the challenge of creatively capturing an interesting photograph of architecture NOT as most images in this challenge are a photograph of interesting acrchitecture!</td>', 'This image meets the challenge of creatively capturing an interesting photograph of architecture NOT as most images in this challenge are a photograph of interesting acrchitecture!', '2006-06-04 08:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483074, 339739, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  There''s some irresistible element of anthropomorphism about this building; it seems wilfully malevolent.   Of course it''s partly the brooding angle and partly the severe, deep-space-bronze processing, but the effect is absolutely striking.  You have captured the building as an emotional presence rather than as a utilitarian construction.  10.</td>', 'Beautiful.  There''s some irresistible element of anthropomorphism about this building; it seems wilfully malevolent.   Of course it''s partly the brooding angle and partly the severe, deep-space-bronze processing, but the effect is absolutely striking.  You have captured the building as an emotional presence rather than as a utilitarian construction.  10.', '2006-06-04 08:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2483075, 339124, 32885, '<td valign="top">This image meets the challenge of creatively capturing an interesting photograph of architecture NOT as most images in this challenge are a photograph of interesting acrchitecture!</td>', 'This image meets the challenge of creatively capturing an interesting photograph of architecture NOT as most images in this challenge are a photograph of interesting acrchitecture!', '2006-06-04 08:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
