(2485203, 338738, 48717, '<td valign="top">J.P.  This one is very nice.  It cought my eye when I was browsing.  nice job.  Very ominous feel to it.  Great dance between the water and light...and the water and light.  Make sense?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-05 12:23:04.</i></td>', 'J.P.  This one is very nice.  It cought my eye when I was browsing.  nice job.  Very ominous feel to it.  Great dance between the water and light...and the water and light.  Make sense?', '2006-06-05 02:20:15.000000', '2006-06-05 13:23:04.000000', 0),
