(2485322, 339116, 21816, '<td valign="top">Ahh....the ugliest building in Perth!! :)<br/> <br/>I used to work at Harvey Norman in Joondalup opposite this eyesore whilst it was being built and I thought it was only half completed when someone told me it was actually finished!  Who approves things like this I wonder?<br/> <br/>You''ve done well with the photo though. The lighting is spot on and you''ve chosen a good section of it to frame. Good stuff Adrian!</td>', 'Ahh....the ugliest building in Perth!! :) I used to work at Harvey Norman in Joondalup opposite this eyesore whilst it was being built and I thought it was only half completed when someone told me it was actually finished!  Who approves things like this I wonder? You''ve done well with the photo though. The lighting is spot on and you''ve chosen a good section of it to frame. Good stuff Adrian!', '2006-06-05 02:51:04.000000', NULL, 0),
