(2485424, 339370, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Apee:</b></div><hr/><i> Well... another case of Plagiarism... but yours less apparent so... 3 </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Naughty Chris ... you <i>know</i> you should not photograph anything that''s been photographed before.<br/>Lately I have taken to listening only to music that''s never been played previously.  It''s a new genre, really; I call it WTF music.<br/>But I had to draw the line somewhere, so I read only those books that I have already read.  You should try it; it''s just like <i>deja vu</i> all over again!</td>', 'Originally posted by Apee: Well... another case of Plagiarism... but yours less apparent so... 3  Naughty Chris ... you know you should not photograph anything that''s been photographed before.Lately I have taken to listening only to music that''s never been played previously.  It''s a new genre, really; I call it WTF music.But I had to draw the line somewhere, so I read only those books that I have already read.  You should try it; it''s just like deja vu all over again!', '2006-06-05 03:42:22.000000', NULL, 0),
