(2485532, 339739, 57886, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments and votes. I got some comments on cropping the corner of the building... It was not on purpose :o) I am almost 8 months pregnant and just couldn´t get any lower for this picture. Really had to lay down in the last step and it was not easy.. :o)<br/>(I must have looked so funny shooting this picture )..<br/> <br/>It would probably have turned out better if I had used my wide lense but I don´t have any filter for that one and really wanted to make this one a long exposure one.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for your comments and votes. I got some comments on cropping the corner of the building... It was not on purpose :o) I am almost 8 months pregnant and just couldn´t get any lower for this picture. Really had to lay down in the last step and it was not easy.. :o)(I must have looked so funny shooting this picture ).. It would probably have turned out better if I had used my wide lense but I don´t have any filter for that one and really wanted to make this one a long exposure one. ', '2006-06-05 04:32:20.000000', NULL, 0),
