(2485563, 339506, 57229, '<td valign="top">The priest must think you''ve got religion. I can see why you''d keep going back to this church as subject though.<br/> <br/>Is there a lot of PP to get the lighting/patina effect? I notice it is present in your other shot of the church - well lit, maybe.<br/> <br/>Lovely shot anyway. Ah, fickle voters...</td>', 'The priest must think you''ve got religion. I can see why you''d keep going back to this church as subject though. Is there a lot of PP to get the lighting/patina effect? I notice it is present in your other shot of the church - well lit, maybe. Lovely shot anyway. Ah, fickle voters...', '2006-06-05 04:50:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2485570, 339124, 39007, '<td valign="top">Freaky - first and third both by Aussies and shot under bridges. Really creative shot. The composition using only two colours makes it!<br/> <br/>Cogratulations from another Aussie.<br/> <br/>edit tpying!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-06 06:20:27.</i></td>', 'Freaky - first and third both by Aussies and shot under bridges. Really creative shot. The composition using only two colours makes it! Cogratulations from another Aussie. edit tpying!', '2006-06-05 04:52:28.000000', '2006-06-06 07:20:27.000000', 0),
