(2485604, 339083, 57358, '<td valign="top">hmm, the reflections in the glass are very nice, maybe you could have just cropped out the top and bottom, so that only the 6 windows were left, and yes, straighten the pic out as best you can, maybe also brighten your colors and contrast, I agree with Rikki''s comment and also, maybe there is some way you could have gotten rid of the bright spot between the last two windows on the bottom row...  you''ve got the right idea though</td>', 'hmm, the reflections in the glass are very nice, maybe you could have just cropped out the top and bottom, so that only the 6 windows were left, and yes, straighten the pic out as best you can, maybe also brighten your colors and contrast, I agree with Rikki''s comment and also, maybe there is some way you could have gotten rid of the bright spot between the last two windows on the bottom row...  you''ve got the right idea though', '2006-06-05 05:18:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2485607, 339711, 36999, '<td valign="top">I spotted your outtake <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=341804" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12857/thumb/341804.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12857/thumb/341804.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12857/thumb/341804.jpg"/></a>  and KNEW you had to be fellow New Mexican!   Love this entry, just lovely!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-05 04:21:57.</i></td>', 'I spotted your outtake   and KNEW you had to be fellow New Mexican!   Love this entry, just lovely!', '2006-06-05 05:20:34.000000', '2006-06-05 05:21:57.000000', 0),
(2485611, 339682, 57358, '<td valign="top">well, I commented on the tiltedness, but also, I see you added a gradient, I was going to suggest that, maybe your gradient should have been a little more dramatic and a darker blue, seems a little grayish still, focus and color on the building look good, crisp and interesting</td>', 'well, I commented on the tiltedness, but also, I see you added a gradient, I was going to suggest that, maybe your gradient should have been a little more dramatic and a darker blue, seems a little grayish still, focus and color on the building look good, crisp and interesting', '2006-06-05 05:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2485615, 338374, 57358, '<td valign="top">I agree with the posts below.  black arch-way and fish eye look aren''t really complementing, the colors are nice, but the focus needs to be sharper to bring out the textures, also maybe a different angle could make this photo more interesting, I like the border though, I think it goes well with the dark red, white and black of the image</td>', 'I agree with the posts below.  black arch-way and fish eye look aren''t really complementing, the colors are nice, but the focus needs to be sharper to bring out the textures, also maybe a different angle could make this photo more interesting, I like the border though, I think it goes well with the dark red, white and black of the image', '2006-06-05 05:25:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2485622, 339159, 41337, '<td valign="top">The title says it all. Wonderful capture!</td>', 'The title says it all. Wonderful capture!', '2006-06-05 05:30:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2485626, 338500, 57358, '<td valign="top">yeah, maybe if you could have found an interesting perspective to shoot from, this could have been better, the colors are good though</td>', 'yeah, maybe if you could have found an interesting perspective to shoot from, this could have been better, the colors are good though', '2006-06-05 05:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
