(2485844, 339737, 57658, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the views and comments all .. this was my first entry and I should have been focusing on the church instead of the tower - the clouds were pretty light and I wanted to make sure they came out right.<br/> <br/>It was a last minute submission and having never done it I didn''t know how to resize and make it web viewable better - I just kept dropping jpg quality to make it smaller. Since then I''ve read EddyG''s tutorial on this so I should do better next time <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-05 06:55:00.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the views and comments all .. this was my first entry and I should have been focusing on the church instead of the tower - the clouds were pretty light and I wanted to make sure they came out right. It was a last minute submission and having never done it I didn''t know how to resize and make it web viewable better - I just kept dropping jpg quality to make it smaller. Since then I''ve read EddyG''s tutorial on this so I should do better next time ', '2006-06-05 07:52:46.000000', '2006-06-05 07:55:00.000000', 0),
