(2485865, 339608, 57658, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - I was there at the Strata center trying to get a picture for the challenge but ran out of memory after 3 snaps. I also made the mistake of waiting for dusk because I hoped the lighting would be more interesting then. I saw the front of the building and never saw this photo - so good eye :).<br/> <br/>Just to indicate how much worse it could have been and instead how well you captured it.<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=343340<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=343344<br/> <br/>Congratulations!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-05 07:12:40.</i></td>', 'Excellent capture - I was there at the Strata center trying to get a picture for the challenge but ran out of memory after 3 snaps. I also made the mistake of waiting for dusk because I hoped the lighting would be more interesting then. I saw the front of the building and never saw this photo - so good eye :). Just to indicate how much worse it could have been and instead how well you captured it.//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=343340//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=343344 Congratulations!!', '2006-06-05 08:09:01.000000', '2006-06-05 08:12:40.000000', 0),
