(2487576, 339226, 43410, '<td valign="top">i like this photo, it''s very simple, many different converging lines.<br/> <br/>i think that if you were to make the bottom of the balcony''s line parallel to the bottom of the image, it would have been stronger.  maybe about a 1 or 2 degree Couterclockwise rotation..if you see what i mean.<br/> <br/>overall great image though.  4.9 is not a bad score at all.  great job :)</td>', 'i like this photo, it''s very simple, many different converging lines. i think that if you were to make the bottom of the balcony''s line parallel to the bottom of the image, it would have been stronger.  maybe about a 1 or 2 degree Couterclockwise rotation..if you see what i mean. overall great image though.  4.9 is not a bad score at all.  great job :)', '2006-06-05 20:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487648, 339426, 38267, '<td valign="top">Nice finish Rikki.  You story made me laugh b/c I went to the Palace of Fine Arts as my first choice for this challenge, but saw the fences and thought, "well, I guess its plan B".  So I headed over to the Golden Gate and entered a shot from their instead.  I guess I should have gotten up on a trash can b/c people like the Palace much better than the bridge according to score :).<br/> <br/>Congrats!</td>', 'Nice finish Rikki.  You story made me laugh b/c I went to the Palace of Fine Arts as my first choice for this challenge, but saw the fences and thought, "well, I guess its plan B".  So I headed over to the Golden Gate and entered a shot from their instead.  I guess I should have gotten up on a trash can b/c people like the Palace much better than the bridge according to score :). Congrats!', '2006-06-05 20:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487918, 339580, 49561, '<td valign="top">congrats!</td>', 'congrats!', '2006-06-05 22:04:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487921, 339426, 49561, '<td valign="top">Great image. Congrats!</td>', 'Great image. Congrats!', '2006-06-05 22:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487928, 339318, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think the focus here is great but there is nothing that really captures my interest. The sky is barren of clouds so it doesn''t make it all that interesting. I think this would have been a stronger shot had you focused mostly on the intricate details of the building. The freizes along the side of the building would be a wonderful close-up. If it was a whole building, a night time shot would have been highly effective.</td>', 'I think the focus here is great but there is nothing that really captures my interest. The sky is barren of clouds so it doesn''t make it all that interesting. I think this would have been a stronger shot had you focused mostly on the intricate details of the building. The freizes along the side of the building would be a wonderful close-up. If it was a whole building, a night time shot would have been highly effective.', '2006-06-05 22:07:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487937, 339675, 37893, '<td valign="top">The color of the building appears to flat against a rather uninteresting sky. The gradiation is there which is great but the image holds hardly any interest for the voters to linger. What is highly effective in architectural type shots is visual interest. The reflections from the adjacent building seems distracting and serves no apparent purpose. Much like other entries I''ve commented on, this would have been great had a close up view of one of the elements were shown.</td>', 'The color of the building appears to flat against a rather uninteresting sky. The gradiation is there which is great but the image holds hardly any interest for the voters to linger. What is highly effective in architectural type shots is visual interest. The reflections from the adjacent building seems distracting and serves no apparent purpose. Much like other entries I''ve commented on, this would have been great had a close up view of one of the elements were shown.', '2006-06-05 22:10:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487940, 338570, 32378, '<td valign="top">Great shot Bob, I really like the reflection.</td>', 'Great shot Bob, I really like the reflection.', '2006-06-05 22:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487946, 339265, 37893, '<td valign="top">There are a couple of things that hurt this image IMHO. One is the space to the left of the image compared to the ones on the right. It''s too loose if compared to teh right side crop. The otehr is that the windows are completely black and uninteresting. The typical view of a home is usually one where activity and life can be portrayed. There is a dog so it seems to me that there is someone living there. Had there been lights within the house, I bet this would have been vastly different.</td>', 'There are a couple of things that hurt this image IMHO. One is the space to the left of the image compared to the ones on the right. It''s too loose if compared to teh right side crop. The otehr is that the windows are completely black and uninteresting. The typical view of a home is usually one where activity and life can be portrayed. There is a dog so it seems to me that there is someone living there. Had there been lights within the house, I bet this would have been vastly different.', '2006-06-05 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2488146, 339580, 22734, '<td valign="top">By far one of the most dynamic images in the realm of DPC. While the lens lends it distortion, the overall perpective impact wins the day. The immediate impression is like a giant spaceship invading a city. An image that is totally impossible if the camera copied the eye 100% You deserve the highest kudos because you selected this breathtaking angle.<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS on you well deserved BLUE.</td>', 'By far one of the most dynamic images in the realm of DPC. While the lens lends it distortion, the overall perpective impact wins the day. The immediate impression is like a giant spaceship invading a city. An image that is totally impossible if the camera copied the eye 100% You deserve the highest kudos because you selected this breathtaking angle. CONGRATULATIONS on you well deserved BLUE.', '2006-06-05 23:28:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2488150, 339633, 22734, '<td valign="top">A fine art study that pleases with its form and coloration. Congratulations on your Red.</td>', 'A fine art study that pleases with its form and coloration. Congratulations on your Red.', '2006-06-05 23:29:39.000000', NULL, 0),
