(2488189, 339643, 22734, '<td valign="top">Construction experts fear working with these designs because of the complexity and the untold special orders and then the delays to bring it to fruition. A dynamite capture with its own twist. Congratulations on your top ten finish.</td>', 'Construction experts fear working with these designs because of the complexity and the untold special orders and then the delays to bring it to fruition. A dynamite capture with its own twist. Congratulations on your top ten finish.', '2006-06-05 23:39:12.000000', NULL, 0),
