(2488946, 339124, 39121, '<td valign="top">Great shot.<br/> <br/>By the way, which bridge in Melbourne is this under? I''ve lived here all my life and cant picture it. Is it the Spencer/Clarendon St bridge over the yarra, or St Kilda Rd, or somewhere else completely? <br/> <br/></td>', 'Great shot. By the way, which bridge in Melbourne is this under? I''ve lived here all my life and cant picture it. Is it the Spencer/Clarendon St bridge over the yarra, or St Kilda Rd, or somewhere else completely?  ', '2006-06-06 03:59:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2489015, 339124, 44597, '<td valign="top">Obviously NOT the Yarra!!!  Excellent effect with the light, which lens did you use?   Were you in a boat?   All in all a great shot, congratulations.</td>', 'Obviously NOT the Yarra!!!  Excellent effect with the light, which lens did you use?   Were you in a boat?   All in all a great shot, congratulations.', '2006-06-06 04:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2489025, 339124, 44597, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kari1:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m trying to figure out why the photographer didn''t straighten the image up, such a quick fix for such a major booboo. That must be what held it back from being a Blue </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I can''t believe you think it needs straightening!   Composition is not about straight lines and water does not run uphill?</td>', 'Originally posted by kari1: I''m trying to figure out why the photographer didn''t straighten the image up, such a quick fix for such a major booboo. That must be what held it back from being a Blue   I can''t believe you think it needs straightening!   Composition is not about straight lines and water does not run uphill?', '2006-06-06 04:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2489034, 339580, 44597, '<td valign="top">Great detail, very nice.   I have taken many from observatory hill of the bridge, but this is a very different perspective, well done.<br/> <br/>How do you find the Sigma lens?</td>', 'Great detail, very nice.   I have taken many from observatory hill of the bridge, but this is a very different perspective, well done. How do you find the Sigma lens?', '2006-06-06 04:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2489042, 339643, 37893, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 10 my friend and your PB ;) I was hoping someone would enter a Calatrava building and you didn''t disappoint. You''re luck to have a building this size. We only have a bridge close by (in my portfolio) and one in Wisconsin ;)<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'Congrats on top 10 my friend and your PB ;) I was hoping someone would enter a Calatrava building and you didn''t disappoint. You''re luck to have a building this size. We only have a bridge close by (in my portfolio) and one in Wisconsin ;) Great job!', '2006-06-06 04:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2489046, 339124, 18932, '<td valign="top">Very very very very nice. Colours, textures, lines. You got it.</td>', 'Very very very very nice. Colours, textures, lines. You got it.', '2006-06-06 04:52:02.000000', NULL, 0),
