(2494884, 339391, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: WOW. Congrats on your new PB, once again. And on a top 20. Wonderful shot.<br/><b>Composition</b>: absolutely dynamic, off centered, quite interesting.<br/><b>Subject</b>: Obviously, great selection for the challenge.<br/><b>Technical</b>: Lovely tonality (is a duotone or just is so white and blue?). The focus is very good. <br/><b>Improvement</b>: Sorry, no ideas on this one.<br/><b>Summary</b>: GRRRRREAT.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: WOW. Congrats on your new PB, once again. And on a top 20. Wonderful shot.Composition: absolutely dynamic, off centered, quite interesting.Subject: Obviously, great selection for the challenge.Technical: Lovely tonality (is a duotone or just is so white and blue?). The focus is very good. Improvement: Sorry, no ideas on this one.Summary: GRRRRREAT. Álex', '2006-06-07 14:16:16.000000', NULL, 0),
