(2496703, 339861, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/> <br/>Looks like you are starting to play around a bit more with your postprocessing. The shot has a very odd feel to it. A bit overprocessed that makes it almost feel like it is moving. Possibly oversharpened or a bit much contrast. I think the log cabin fit the challenge well and in a welcome different way, but PP hurt it bad.</td>', 'Trading Post - Looks like you are starting to play around a bit more with your postprocessing. The shot has a very odd feel to it. A bit overprocessed that makes it almost feel like it is moving. Possibly oversharpened or a bit much contrast. I think the log cabin fit the challenge well and in a welcome different way, but PP hurt it bad.', '2006-06-07 22:28:49.000000', NULL, 0),
