(2501087, 339201, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>CTPII!</b> <br/>Hey, nice colours. i mean <b>great</b> colours. Can''t say much about the building, though. Pretty drab, actually. Also, there''s a bit of fringing on the edges of the building. A little less sharpening next time, perhaps?</td>', 'CTPII! Hey, nice colours. i mean great colours. Can''t say much about the building, though. Pretty drab, actually. Also, there''s a bit of fringing on the edges of the building. A little less sharpening next time, perhaps?', '2006-06-09 05:31:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2501363, 338528, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  It appears that either my monitor is off, or some voters monitors are off.  My monitor shows this photo as it was, my monitor at work did show a greenish trend.  So, you check your monitor and I''ll check mine.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  It appears that either my monitor is off, or some voters monitors are off.  My monitor shows this photo as it was, my monitor at work did show a greenish trend.  So, you check your monitor and I''ll check mine.', '2006-06-09 08:19:40.000000', NULL, 0),
